(2433303, 333532, 39349, '<td valign="top">Might this be da Queen? Nice shot composure, maybe a little too harsh on the lighting on your shirt. I do like the nibble on the glasses, it gives this shot some feeling and helps it make it not just another portrait. Also seems a bit soft, maybe tone down the neat-image, just a bit. I also like your use of negative space and the color your chose works well here to. Overall a beautiful photo of a beautiful woman. Great job!</td>', 'Might this be da Queen? Nice shot composure, maybe a little too harsh on the lighting on your shirt. I do like the nibble on the glasses, it gives this shot some feeling and helps it make it not just another portrait. Also seems a bit soft, maybe tone down the neat-image, just a bit. I also like your use of negative space and the color your chose works well here to. Overall a beautiful photo of a beautiful woman. Great job!', '2006-05-19 02:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
