(2433704, 335773, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very funny - and colorful too - I love how the background is diffuse and colored in such a way that your face is standing out. 8 from me</td>', 'Very funny - and colorful too - I love how the background is diffuse and colored in such a way that your face is standing out. 8 from me', '2006-05-19 04:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2433705, 335014, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hey. You can dunk your face in a pan full of whipped cream but you''ll never hide your true identity :P Such a prized image. My only thought? Lower the camera so that your hands are in view. Chopping the hands when it''s a seemingly important part of the composition is kinda like a no-no ;) The whites of your eyes are too white ;) When using curves or levels, make sure the opacity of the layer is set to roughly around 45% so that the whites don''t end up looking "evil".<br/> <br/>Great job though my friend :) So how''s the new camera? :)</td>', 'Hey. You can dunk your face in a pan full of whipped cream but you''ll never hide your true identity :P Such a prized image. My only thought? Lower the camera so that your hands are in view. Chopping the hands when it''s a seemingly important part of the composition is kinda like a no-no ;) The whites of your eyes are too white ;) When using curves or levels, make sure the opacity of the layer is set to roughly around 45% so that the whites don''t end up looking "evil". Great job though my friend :) So how''s the new camera? :)', '2006-05-19 04:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2433706, 336230, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great perspective - totally adds to the image - nicely done!</td>', 'Great perspective - totally adds to the image - nicely done!', '2006-05-19 04:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
