(2434099, 336300, 37858, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite photos.  It''s a very stylistic shot...conveys an attraction to the personality of the model as well as to her appearance.  There is character and depth to this portrait.  The picture makes me want to get to know the person inside.  <br/> <br/>Technically, a well-made photo.  Good use of light too.  Very well done.</td>', 'One of my favorite photos.  It''s a very stylistic shot...conveys an attraction to the personality of the model as well as to her appearance.  There is character and depth to this portrait.  The picture makes me want to get to know the person inside.   Technically, a well-made photo.  Good use of light too.  Very well done.', '2006-05-19 06:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
