(2434210, 336268, 28963, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the lighting. Nice facial expression too and great focus and DOF. The leather sofa part is distracting though, maybe if you had burned out the highlights there it would have faded more into the black background.<br/>Still, the more I look the more I like. 7</td>', 'I like the pose and the lighting. Nice facial expression too and great focus and DOF. The leather sofa part is distracting though, maybe if you had burned out the highlights there it would have faded more into the black background.Still, the more I look the more I like. 7', '2006-05-19 07:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434211, 335764, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, Roman ... I like that hat!  But what is also very appealing is the edgy and unsettling feel you''ve achieved with the unusual composition.  It has a tension, maybe a deliberate lack of spatial resolution, that''s uncomfortable and will not let the viewer think "hmmm, nice pic" and pass on without further thought.  There''s a photograph around here somewhere called "Inner Demons" that has the very same unusual and compelling quality.</td>', 'Well, Roman ... I like that hat!  But what is also very appealing is the edgy and unsettling feel you''ve achieved with the unusual composition.  It has a tension, maybe a deliberate lack of spatial resolution, that''s uncomfortable and will not let the viewer think "hmmm, nice pic" and pass on without further thought.  There''s a photograph around here somewhere called "Inner Demons" that has the very same unusual and compelling quality.', '2006-05-19 07:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
