(2434355, 336399, 20506, '<td valign="top">Nice pic love the lighting here, looking at the clothes I have decided you''re either a very hip man of the cloth lol or a very artistic biker. interesting shot well done</td>', 'Nice pic love the lighting here, looking at the clothes I have decided you''re either a very hip man of the cloth lol or a very artistic biker. interesting shot well done', '2006-05-19 08:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434357, 333466, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy effect, it goes well with the theme. The pose, costume and setting look kind of stagey, though.</td>', 'I like the grainy effect, it goes well with the theme. The pose, costume and setting look kind of stagey, though.', '2006-05-19 08:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434359, 336362, 2240, '<td valign="top">I like this. The natural light works well.</td>', 'I like this. The natural light works well.', '2006-05-19 08:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434361, 336040, 48115, '<td valign="top">to much nature to little you! not a portrait in my minde</td>', 'to much nature to little you! not a portrait in my minde', '2006-05-19 08:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434362, 334968, 12733, '<td valign="top">The golden light is great! I like the way you''ve included just a part of your face; it lends an air of mystery. How did you get your hair blowing out that way?</td>', 'The golden light is great! I like the way you''ve included just a part of your face; it lends an air of mystery. How did you get your hair blowing out that way?', '2006-05-19 08:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434363, 335713, 25355, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary. I love the creativity.</td>', 'Extraordinary. I love the creativity.', '2006-05-19 08:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434366, 336405, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and background. This looks like a studio shot. Kind of unimaginative, though.</td>', 'Nice lighting and background. This looks like a studio shot. Kind of unimaginative, though.', '2006-05-19 08:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434367, 336395, 25355, '<td valign="top">8.51</td>', '8.51', '2006-05-19 08:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434370, 334596, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea. I think cropping out your legs might have strengthened both the image and conformance to the title.</td>', 'Very cute idea. I think cropping out your legs might have strengthened both the image and conformance to the title.', '2006-05-19 08:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434371, 336343, 48115, '<td valign="top">I think i know your face miss Monica :) only thing I can see wrong with this is the title..</td>', 'I think i know your face miss Monica :) only thing I can see wrong with this is the title..', '2006-05-19 08:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434373, 335876, 12733, '<td valign="top">The red lighting is a bit much, and I find the head-foot combination more disturbing than interesting. Nice try, but it misses me.</td>', 'The red lighting is a bit much, and I find the head-foot combination more disturbing than interesting. Nice try, but it misses me.', '2006-05-19 08:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434374, 336393, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the idea but the image quality is not so good, needs to be sharper and clearer, this looks moved.</td>', 'Love the idea but the image quality is not so good, needs to be sharper and clearer, this looks moved.', '2006-05-19 08:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434375, 333949, 36499, '<td valign="top">Nice work as usual cindi! You look so relaxed even tho i know how rushed one is making a self port. very well done tho i think just a touch lighter wouldve been better for me. good luck and hope to see this one at the top!<br/> <br/>~~Cher~~ :o)</td>', 'Nice work as usual cindi! You look so relaxed even tho i know how rushed one is making a self port. very well done tho i think just a touch lighter wouldve been better for me. good luck and hope to see this one at the top! ~~Cher~~ :o)', '2006-05-19 08:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434377, 334740, 12733, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice looking mask, and the photo brings it out well. Why are you unwilling to show your own face?</td>', 'That''s a nice looking mask, and the photo brings it out well. Why are you unwilling to show your own face?', '2006-05-19 08:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434380, 336239, 12733, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and a well executed photo. I hope you''ll explain how you did it when the challenge is over.</td>', 'A clever idea and a well executed photo. I hope you''ll explain how you did it when the challenge is over.', '2006-05-19 08:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434381, 336287, 2240, '<td valign="top">It''s fun trying to get the right look in the mirror before you take your picture. Good job.</td>', 'It''s fun trying to get the right look in the mirror before you take your picture. Good job.', '2006-05-19 08:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434384, 334156, 31889, '<td valign="top">This woman isn''t old enough to know anything about the 1960''s. :)  Good job.</td>', 'This woman isn''t old enough to know anything about the 1960''s. :)  Good job.', '2006-05-19 08:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434385, 335351, 18655, '<td valign="top">Wow - you are beautiful! The scratched floor adds a lot of character. Great choice of BW! 10 from me.</td>', 'Wow - you are beautiful! The scratched floor adds a lot of character. Great choice of BW! 10 from me.', '2006-05-19 08:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434386, 335482, 2240, '<td valign="top">Oh my! this is different.</td>', 'Oh my! this is different.', '2006-05-19 08:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434388, 336186, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting statement about your interests - if that''s what it is. Interesting lighting - it brings out the detail.</td>', 'An interesting statement about your interests - if that''s what it is. Interesting lighting - it brings out the detail.', '2006-05-19 08:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434389, 333466, 18655, '<td valign="top">Holy moly - you''re not kiddin'', that does look wicked. Great shot and great choice of BW!</td>', 'Holy moly - you''re not kiddin'', that does look wicked. Great shot and great choice of BW!', '2006-05-19 08:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434393, 334696, 2240, '<td valign="top">Thump Thump     Thump Thump   Thump Thump</td>', 'Thump Thump     Thump Thump   Thump Thump', '2006-05-19 08:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434396, 335351, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and stylish.  Shapes, lines and tones are a lesson to every photographer ... deceptively simple, but it''s actually quite sophisticated.  I guess you just made it <i>look</i> simple.  8.</td>', 'Beautiful and stylish.  Shapes, lines and tones are a lesson to every photographer ... deceptively simple, but it''s actually quite sophisticated.  I guess you just made it look simple.  8.', '2006-05-19 08:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434397, 336349, 25355, '<td valign="top">Who made you do it? Was it idnic?</td>', 'Who made you do it? Was it idnic?', '2006-05-19 08:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434398, 336397, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, and a well executed photo. Great lighting, sharpness and choice of background. Were any clothes damaged in making this photo?</td>', 'An interesting idea, and a well executed photo. Great lighting, sharpness and choice of background. Were any clothes damaged in making this photo?', '2006-05-19 08:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434399, 335456, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the lighting is not so good in this image, my guess is you used an on camera flash?  Just too harsh, it´s blownig out all detail in your face.  Next time try using a bigger lightsource, like a big window during daylight or something like that if you don´t have access to studio lighting.</td>', 'Sorry but the lighting is not so good in this image, my guess is you used an on camera flash?  Just too harsh, it´s blownig out all detail in your face.  Next time try using a bigger lightsource, like a big window during daylight or something like that if you don´t have access to studio lighting.', '2006-05-19 08:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434402, 336040, 27482, '<td valign="top">Saturation a bit too strong for my taste but nice scenery!</td>', 'Saturation a bit too strong for my taste but nice scenery!', '2006-05-19 08:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434404, 333906, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great sky, great landscape.</td>', 'Great sky, great landscape.', '2006-05-19 08:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434406, 333445, 15266, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, Cher.  I like the flowy white fabric.  The eyes are a tad over-saturated, but gives a dreamy look that works with the rest of the image.  :)</td>', 'Lovely portrait, Cher.  I like the flowy white fabric.  The eyes are a tad over-saturated, but gives a dreamy look that works with the rest of the image.  :)', '2006-05-19 08:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434408, 336318, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but I would have liked this better if there was a catchlight in the eye, seems a little dead/dull as it is.</td>', 'Not bad but I would have liked this better if there was a catchlight in the eye, seems a little dead/dull as it is.', '2006-05-19 08:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434410, 335456, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I love the Ms. innocent expression!</td>', 'Very nice - I love the Ms. innocent expression!', '2006-05-19 08:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434411, 334953, 2240, '<td valign="top">Go back to bed :) :) good job.</td>', 'Go back to bed :) :) good job.', '2006-05-19 08:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434412, 336402, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, nicely executed.</td>', 'Interesting idea, nicely executed.', '2006-05-19 08:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434415, 336247, 2240, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2006-05-19 08:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434419, 333592, 31889, '<td valign="top">Love the negative space and, dare I say it, messy hair :) .  Just a bit more face would''ve worked better for me but still a good submission.</td>', 'Love the negative space and, dare I say it, messy hair :) .  Just a bit more face would''ve worked better for me but still a good submission.', '2006-05-19 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434422, 336304, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this picture holds meaning for you. It doesn''t come through to me, sorry.</td>', 'I''m sure this picture holds meaning for you. It doesn''t come through to me, sorry.', '2006-05-19 08:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434424, 336389, 2240, '<td valign="top">Cool eyes.</td>', 'Cool eyes.', '2006-05-19 08:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434426, 333448, 36499, '<td valign="top">even tho i cant vote you for this I think you did a GREAT job hunny for your first self portrait!</td>', 'even tho i cant vote you for this I think you did a GREAT job hunny for your first self portrait!', '2006-05-19 08:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434429, 336333, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great - you stand out beautifully against the black background.</td>', 'The lighting is great - you stand out beautifully against the black background.', '2006-05-19 08:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434433, 333512, 12733, '<td valign="top">Definitely an example of "less is more." Great filling the frame, and sharp rendition, good lighting.</td>', 'Definitely an example of "less is more." Great filling the frame, and sharp rendition, good lighting.', '2006-05-19 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434437, 335250, 31889, '<td valign="top">Good fun portrait.  A less obtrusive background would''ve made this a winner in my books.</td>', 'Good fun portrait.  A less obtrusive background would''ve made this a winner in my books.', '2006-05-19 08:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434438, 335510, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way you stand out against the black background, then shade into it. Nice, sharp rendition.</td>', 'I like the way you stand out against the black background, then shade into it. Nice, sharp rendition.', '2006-05-19 08:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434439, 336389, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea with the selective desatutration. I like the clearity in this as well.</td>', 'Great idea with the selective desatutration. I like the clearity in this as well.', '2006-05-19 08:59:56.000000', NULL, 1);
