(2434470, 336244, 30364, '<td valign="top">Almost went right by this, I guess because it is low key and understated by comparison with some of the more strident shots.  Happily, I looked a for second longer and realised how good, how well conceived and executed, it actually is.  Its impact steadily grows with each moment''s consideration, which is exactly the opposite of most of those more attention-seeking shots.  It''s a lovely, enduring portrait.  8.</td>', 'Almost went right by this, I guess because it is low key and understated by comparison with some of the more strident shots.  Happily, I looked a for second longer and realised how good, how well conceived and executed, it actually is.  Its impact steadily grows with each moment''s consideration, which is exactly the opposite of most of those more attention-seeking shots.  It''s a lovely, enduring portrait.  8.', '2006-05-19 09:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434471, 335764, 12733, '<td valign="top">The expression, background chair and pose seem to tell a story - but what story?</td>', 'The expression, background chair and pose seem to tell a story - but what story?', '2006-05-19 09:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434476, 336155, 12733, '<td valign="top">Mr. Potato Head lives. Very clever, and the black background works well.</td>', 'Mr. Potato Head lives. Very clever, and the black background works well.', '2006-05-19 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434477, 335672, 18655, '<td valign="top">This is truly very cool - great idea! Good job in getting the lighting reasonably good on all of the heads</td>', 'This is truly very cool - great idea! Good job in getting the lighting reasonably good on all of the heads', '2006-05-19 09:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434479, 336066, 2240, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is great.The model,water,landscape.</td>', 'WOW! This is great.The model,water,landscape.', '2006-05-19 09:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
