(2434506, 334759, 29154, '<td valign="top">I knew you would enter this one in the Self Portrait Challenge ! I saw it in your PBase gallery. Absolutely beautiful ! I didn''t see all the other entries, but I''m sure you will do very well. I would have like to enter this challenge, but I had no time and no inspiration .... Good luck Nasti :)</td>', 'I knew you would enter this one in the Self Portrait Challenge ! I saw it in your PBase gallery. Absolutely beautiful ! I didn''t see all the other entries, but I''m sure you will do very well. I would have like to enter this challenge, but I had no time and no inspiration .... Good luck Nasti :)', '2006-05-19 09:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2434513, 336212, 18655, '<td valign="top">Wow - you seriously look like Niles Crane (his real name escaped my right now). Nice lighting</td>', 'Wow - you seriously look like Niles Crane (his real name escaped my right now). Nice lighting', '2006-05-19 09:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
