(2434543, 333976, 30364, '<td valign="top">The idea and the photographic execution of it are both terrific.  And I love the guarded facial expression, especially for the clever title.  There''s something slightly strange about the processing; the hand looks slightly fake, like it''s been added later.  Maybe that''s just me; I often feel that way myself!  Anyway, it''s a very good and interesting portrait.  7.</td>', 'The idea and the photographic execution of it are both terrific.  And I love the guarded facial expression, especially for the clever title.  There''s something slightly strange about the processing; the hand looks slightly fake, like it''s been added later.  Maybe that''s just me; I often feel that way myself!  Anyway, it''s a very good and interesting portrait.  7.', '2006-05-19 09:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
