(2434552, 336164, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific!  It <i>demands</i> the attention of the viewer, not just because it is visually startling, but also because it clearly has something more to say than "just ''nother pretty girl here".  It''s two distinct pictures; (a) the subject on the right, and (b) the "other" person on the left looking at the subject.  It creates the strong impression for me that I am standing beside the person on the left and we are <i>both</i> looking at the subject on the right, as if she were a painting.  It''s a strange but pleasant illusion.  I have no clue if that''s what you intended, but I sure hope so.  10.</td>', 'Terrific!  It demands the attention of the viewer, not just because it is visually startling, but also because it clearly has something more to say than "just ''nother pretty girl here".  It''s two distinct pictures; (a) the subject on the right, and (b) the "other" person on the left looking at the subject.  It creates the strong impression for me that I am standing beside the person on the left and we are both looking at the subject on the right, as if she were a painting.  It''s a strange but pleasant illusion.  I have no clue if that''s what you intended, but I sure hope so.  10.', '2006-05-19 09:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
