(2434606, 335103, 5728, '<td valign="top">You used the full tonal range perfectly here, the conversion to B&amp;W was a good choice. Taking a photo of someone with glasses, especially a self portrait is not easy. It is difficult to get the side of the person''s face lined up with the "through the glass" side of the face. But here you lined it all up well. And you are very photogenic, I would love to photograph you one day :)</td>', 'You used the full tonal range perfectly here, the conversion to B&W was a good choice. Taking a photo of someone with glasses, especially a self portrait is not easy. It is difficult to get the side of the person''s face lined up with the "through the glass" side of the face. But here you lined it all up well. And you are very photogenic, I would love to photograph you one day :)', '2006-05-19 09:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
