(2435930, 335659, 40126, '<td valign="top">cool image bro 9</td>', 'cool image bro 9', '2006-05-19 13:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435931, 334765, 52336, '<td valign="top">Probably one of my favourites... really quite an awesome photo.  No way to improve on this, because everything is just so right.</td>', 'Probably one of my favourites... really quite an awesome photo.  No way to improve on this, because everything is just so right.', '2006-05-19 13:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435933, 336258, 18349, '<td valign="top">It''s the lovely Mambe!!!  Beautiful colors and clarity... wonderful desaturization on this image.  Even with the color surrounding your face, your eyes really sparkle and draw the focus to them.  :)</td>', 'It''s the lovely Mambe!!!  Beautiful colors and clarity... wonderful desaturization on this image.  Even with the color surrounding your face, your eyes really sparkle and draw the focus to them.  :)', '2006-05-19 13:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435935, 335482, 40126, '<td valign="top">you''re funny 8</td>', 'you''re funny 8', '2006-05-19 13:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435938, 335679, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice and edgy, but I wish your eyes were a bit more lively.  A catchlight or something less flat would really have improved.  I understand though that some may argue that it adds to that sombre feel it has, but I think something else there would really have worked.  Great otherwise.</td>', 'Nice and edgy, but I wish your eyes were a bit more lively.  A catchlight or something less flat would really have improved.  I understand though that some may argue that it adds to that sombre feel it has, but I think something else there would really have worked.  Great otherwise.', '2006-05-19 13:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435945, 336395, 5728, '<td valign="top">8:51 as you''ve probably been told before. Is that alarm ringing? Looks like the hammer is in action there. And who could mistake those lovely green eyes :) Good to see you back girl. Awesome portrait! Favourited.</td>', '8:51 as you''ve probably been told before. Is that alarm ringing? Looks like the hammer is in action there. And who could mistake those lovely green eyes :) Good to see you back girl. Awesome portrait! Favourited.', '2006-05-19 13:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435946, 335835, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a bit too soft in my opinion... you may have done that purposefully, but the beard and hair, I think, want this picture to have more clarity.  Background lighting is awesome, giving the left half of the image great emphasis.</td>', 'Nice, but a bit too soft in my opinion... you may have done that purposefully, but the beard and hair, I think, want this picture to have more clarity.  Background lighting is awesome, giving the left half of the image great emphasis.', '2006-05-19 13:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435949, 335250, 2764, '<td valign="top">oh drat!  I didn''t mean to vote on this challenge but NOW I have to vote on 20% so i can give this a ten!  Excellent, those oranges make it perfect.</td>', 'oh drat!  I didn''t mean to vote on this challenge but NOW I have to vote on 20% so i can give this a ten!  Excellent, those oranges make it perfect.', '2006-05-19 13:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435951, 336288, 52336, '<td valign="top">Just too soft, I think.. great light in the eyes, but they really need to be sharper in my opinion.  Great colours.</td>', 'Just too soft, I think.. great light in the eyes, but they really need to be sharper in my opinion.  Great colours.', '2006-05-19 13:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435955, 335259, 39349, '<td valign="top">AAAAHHHHH, da cheese man! Great job, thanks for not making me look at your ass this time! hahaha!</td>', 'AAAAHHHHH, da cheese man! Great job, thanks for not making me look at your ass this time! hahaha!', '2006-05-19 13:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435956, 336148, 2764, '<td valign="top">10, as usual.</td>', '10, as usual.', '2006-05-19 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435958, 333465, 52336, '<td valign="top">Wow, it''s Mystique! ;)  Very jarring on first view, an immediate positive impact.  Great soft lighting and of course colour, and the eyes are perfect.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow, it''s Mystique! ;)  Very jarring on first view, an immediate positive impact.  Great soft lighting and of course colour, and the eyes are perfect.  Well done!', '2006-05-19 13:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435962, 336139, 52336, '<td valign="top">Funny and nicely put together.  Well done.</td>', 'Funny and nicely put together.  Well done.', '2006-05-19 13:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435966, 333769, 39349, '<td valign="top">Love the tones working for you here against the leather and your hair. Lighting is very nice and I get a relaxing feeling viewing this. Beautiful work.</td>', 'Love the tones working for you here against the leather and your hair. Lighting is very nice and I get a relaxing feeling viewing this. Beautiful work.', '2006-05-19 13:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435971, 335257, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice image with lots of emotion I think.  Maybe your legs need to be a bit lower, or the crop a tad higher.  Otherwise, lovely tone and composition.</td>', 'Nice image with lots of emotion I think.  Maybe your legs need to be a bit lower, or the crop a tad higher.  Otherwise, lovely tone and composition.', '2006-05-19 13:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435974, 335951, 39349, '<td valign="top">This shot is over the top! I''m going to pick this one for the blue. Amazing detail throughout. Into my favs and a 10 from me.</td>', 'This shot is over the top! I''m going to pick this one for the blue. Amazing detail throughout. Into my favs and a 10 from me.', '2006-05-19 13:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435975, 335377, 38248, '<td valign="top">Awesome.</td>', 'Awesome.', '2006-05-19 13:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435977, 335977, 38248, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-05-19 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435978, 336339, 52336, '<td valign="top">Fantastic clarity.  The only thing bugging me is the wall''s edge (?) growing from the top of your head.  I wish the background were totally smooth.  Perfect otherwise.</td>', 'Fantastic clarity.  The only thing bugging me is the wall''s edge (?) growing from the top of your head.  I wish the background were totally smooth.  Perfect otherwise.', '2006-05-19 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435981, 335779, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very neat, a great portrait.</td>', 'Very neat, a great portrait.', '2006-05-19 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435987, 336193, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Out of focus hands are taking a bit away from it overall though, in my opinion, because they''re actually brighter than your face, so they''re the first thing I looked at.  Love the bokeh and the expression (or what there is of it) ;).  Other than the hands, it''s a great portrait and well done.</td>', 'Very nice.  Out of focus hands are taking a bit away from it overall though, in my opinion, because they''re actually brighter than your face, so they''re the first thing I looked at.  Love the bokeh and the expression (or what there is of it) ;).  Other than the hands, it''s a great portrait and well done.', '2006-05-19 13:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435988, 333563, 52336, '<td valign="top">Wow, perfect. :)</td>', 'Wow, perfect. :)', '2006-05-19 13:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435989, 335011, 42181, '<td valign="top">IMO a little too much neat image. Good picture though. 7</td>', 'IMO a little too much neat image. Good picture though. 7', '2006-05-19 13:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435990, 336308, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice and kind of edgy.  Great shadows, and your left eye is well caught.</td>', 'Very, very nice and kind of edgy.  Great shadows, and your left eye is well caught.', '2006-05-19 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435991, 335351, 39349, '<td valign="top">Amazing tones! I love the reflection in the well used floor. Beautiful work.</td>', 'Amazing tones! I love the reflection in the well used floor. Beautiful work.', '2006-05-19 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435993, 336258, 35804, '<td valign="top">Hi Mambe! Love how you have used the color in the image...very nice!</td>', 'Hi Mambe! Love how you have used the color in the image...very nice!', '2006-05-19 13:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2435998, 334740, 42181, '<td valign="top">Are you shy ?  ;-)</td>', 'Are you shy ?  ;-)', '2006-05-19 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436000, 335996, 52336, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, nice lighting choices... the flare adds something to it in my opinion.  Really great portrait.</td>', 'Excellent composition, nice lighting choices... the flare adds something to it in my opinion.  Really great portrait.', '2006-05-19 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436003, 336289, 35804, '<td valign="top">...now this is a cool trick...float on.</td>', '...now this is a cool trick...float on.', '2006-05-19 13:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436004, 335257, 5728, '<td valign="top">Mandy this is wonderful. Although it is all set up it still pours out emotion, both your faces looks so realistically natural. The sadness and tears in your eyes and the vacant look on the boy''s face (your son?) are telling me a sad story full of impact. The gentle but protective way you are holding the boy with your hands and also with your legs works into the story naturally. If I could chose one image from the whole lot which would evoke emotions in the viewer, this one would be it. Fine work Mandy, respect!</td>', 'Mandy this is wonderful. Although it is all set up it still pours out emotion, both your faces looks so realistically natural. The sadness and tears in your eyes and the vacant look on the boy''s face (your son?) are telling me a sad story full of impact. The gentle but protective way you are holding the boy with your hands and also with your legs works into the story naturally. If I could chose one image from the whole lot which would evoke emotions in the viewer, this one would be it. Fine work Mandy, respect!', '2006-05-19 13:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436005, 335743, 39349, '<td valign="top">Shecoya? I love your eyes here, your title is perfect as well. Awesome DOF and sharpness make this a pleasure to view. Well done!</td>', 'Shecoya? I love your eyes here, your title is perfect as well. Awesome DOF and sharpness make this a pleasure to view. Well done!', '2006-05-19 13:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436006, 335916, 52336, '<td valign="top">Really needs a bit more sharpness in my opinion, especially at the eyes, because this is otherwise a fantastic portrait... light is great.</td>', 'Really needs a bit more sharpness in my opinion, especially at the eyes, because this is otherwise a fantastic portrait... light is great.', '2006-05-19 13:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436008, 335526, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Knives need to be a bit sharper (no pun intended) to strengthen the impact of this.  Light''s great.</td>', 'Very cool.  Knives need to be a bit sharper (no pun intended) to strengthen the impact of this.  Light''s great.', '2006-05-19 13:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436010, 335022, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great tones and I like how you''ve focused on the glasses and your eyes. Well done.</td>', 'Great tones and I like how you''ve focused on the glasses and your eyes. Well done.', '2006-05-19 13:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436011, 335011, 52336, '<td valign="top">Fantastic light... if you could have somehow toned down the shadow under the nose, this would really be perfect.</td>', 'Fantastic light... if you could have somehow toned down the shadow under the nose, this would really be perfect.', '2006-05-19 13:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436014, 335510, 52336, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice.. great light and tone choices, and your position in the frame is great.  An awesome portrait.</td>', 'Pretty nice.. great light and tone choices, and your position in the frame is great.  An awesome portrait.', '2006-05-19 13:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436016, 335977, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very very beautiful... the softness and bit of grain are a perfect match!  Wonderful portrait.</td>', 'Very very beautiful... the softness and bit of grain are a perfect match!  Wonderful portrait.', '2006-05-19 13:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436017, 335963, 50127, '<td valign="top">too much forehead, would look better cropped tighter or centered lower<br/>gorgeous eyes, though</td>', 'too much forehead, would look better cropped tighter or centered lowergorgeous eyes, though', '2006-05-19 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436018, 335313, 52336, '<td valign="top">It''s just that the eyes look a bit overprocessed... maybe I''m wrong but I believe I see artefacts of a selection area around them.  Nice desaturation though, and lighting is very cool and dramatic.  Great setup choice, and overall a nice portrait.</td>', 'It''s just that the eyes look a bit overprocessed... maybe I''m wrong but I believe I see artefacts of a selection area around them.  Nice desaturation though, and lighting is very cool and dramatic.  Great setup choice, and overall a nice portrait.', '2006-05-19 13:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436019, 334933, 35804, '<td valign="top">I like this very much...the square format is perfect...lovely tones and light.</td>', 'I like this very much...the square format is perfect...lovely tones and light.', '2006-05-19 13:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436020, 336344, 52336, '<td valign="top">Really great portrait, well executed.</td>', 'Really great portrait, well executed.', '2006-05-19 13:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2436025, 336253, 52336, '<td valign="top">Wow, gorgeous... prefect saturation and an excellent frame.  Lighting is soft and wonderful.  Great portrait.</td>', 'Wow, gorgeous... prefect saturation and an excellent frame.  Lighting is soft and wonderful.  Great portrait.', '2006-05-19 13:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
