(2437688, 335328, 3032, '<td valign="top">The glasses reminded me of something because they are pretty cool.<br/>I didn''t take me long to find the Miami Vice shot for the ''80s challenge.<br/> <br/>So I guess that this is you, Alex Saberi.<br/> <br/>Another great portrait shot. 10 for me. The balance between the skin tone and blue background is very good and so is the posing and lighting.</td>', 'The glasses reminded me of something because they are pretty cool.I didn''t take me long to find the Miami Vice shot for the ''80s challenge. So I guess that this is you, Alex Saberi. Another great portrait shot. 10 for me. The balance between the skin tone and blue background is very good and so is the posing and lighting.', '2006-05-19 19:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
