(2438260, 335996, 11843, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I think it could use some cropping. The flare is good, but if it were cropped just shy of the circles from the flare, it could be great. That blob of whitish stuff at the top right is distracting.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I think it could use some cropping. The flare is good, but if it were cropped just shy of the circles from the flare, it could be great. That blob of whitish stuff at the top right is distracting.', '2006-05-19 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438263, 335774, 11843, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop. Good details. Maybe remove the spec of frame from your glasses on the right. Well done.</td>', 'I like the tight crop. Good details. Maybe remove the spec of frame from your glasses on the right. Well done.', '2006-05-19 22:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438266, 335903, 11843, '<td valign="top">Lighting is kinda harsh and the thing in the pocket is distracting. Otherwise a nice candid.</td>', 'Lighting is kinda harsh and the thing in the pocket is distracting. Otherwise a nice candid.', '2006-05-19 23:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438273, 336026, 11843, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast. I think a tighter crop off the right would have helped. It seems a little tight on the left. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the contrast. I think a tighter crop off the right would have helped. It seems a little tight on the left. Nice work.', '2006-05-19 23:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438276, 335456, 11843, '<td valign="top">Great color!!! Love those eyes and eyelids. Lighting seems a bit harsh and the crop is a bit tight on the left. Nice work.</td>', 'Great color!!! Love those eyes and eyelids. Lighting seems a bit harsh and the crop is a bit tight on the left. Nice work.', '2006-05-19 23:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438280, 333563, 38496, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Funny, and well executed.  I''m guessing Dr.Achoo??  Based on the hippocratic oath reference...</td>', 'Great shot!  Funny, and well executed.  I''m guessing Dr.Achoo??  Based on the hippocratic oath reference...', '2006-05-19 23:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438282, 336243, 38496, '<td valign="top">made me smile.</td>', 'made me smile.', '2006-05-19 23:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438288, 336272, 11843, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! I think the 2:1 crop would have worked better. Cut out the building almost alltogether. I would liked to have seen more facial features too. A reflector would have come in handy in this situation since you are looking down away from the light. Too many shadows. Nit picky really, but I noticed. Great work. 8</td>', 'Great perspective! I think the 2:1 crop would have worked better. Cut out the building almost alltogether. I would liked to have seen more facial features too. A reflector would have come in handy in this situation since you are looking down away from the light. Too many shadows. Nit picky really, but I noticed. Great work. 8', '2006-05-19 23:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438290, 336398, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail. Well done.</td>', 'Nice color and detail. Well done.', '2006-05-19 23:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438297, 336407, 11843, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! I like the way the window cracks are lined up with your left eye. Excellent composition, light, and the slightly muted color. I''m not really liking the white frame. Still Excellent work. 10</td>', 'One of my favorites! I like the way the window cracks are lined up with your left eye. Excellent composition, light, and the slightly muted color. I''m not really liking the white frame. Still Excellent work. 10', '2006-05-19 23:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438299, 334696, 1368, '<td valign="top">I would love a piece of that .. listening pipe :)</td>', 'I would love a piece of that .. listening pipe :)', '2006-05-19 23:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438305, 335859, 11843, '<td valign="top">This photo lacks color on my screen, maybe its just me. Great idea, though.</td>', 'This photo lacks color on my screen, maybe its just me. Great idea, though.', '2006-05-19 23:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2438311, 335014, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good color and expression. Not sure I like seeing those fingers. They are more of a distraction than anything else. Nicely done.</td>', 'Good color and expression. Not sure I like seeing those fingers. They are more of a distraction than anything else. Nicely done.', '2006-05-19 23:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
