(2438365, 336262, 11843, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dark in the face area. Great composition and pose. A reflector would have come in handy in this situation. Well done.</td>', 'Seems a little dark in the face area. Great composition and pose. A reflector would have come in handy in this situation. Well done.', '2006-05-19 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
