(2439596, 335965, 48228, '<td valign="top">Clever.....</td>', 'Clever.....', '2006-05-20 07:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439597, 335259, 36470, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmmm, who could this be? ;o)  <br/> <br/>No-one can resist the Velveeta.</td>', 'Hmmmmmmm, who could this be? ;o)   No-one can resist the Velveeta.', '2006-05-20 07:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439600, 335713, 36470, '<td valign="top">This is very cool.  I think if you brought down the exposure a touch and increased the contrast a tad, it would have even more impact.  8</td>', 'This is very cool.  I think if you brought down the exposure a touch and increased the contrast a tad, it would have even more impact.  8', '2006-05-20 07:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439609, 333530, 36470, '<td valign="top">A very ''Zoolander'' expression :)<br/> <br/>Nice Canon ;o)</td>', 'A very ''Zoolander'' expression :) Nice Canon ;o)', '2006-05-20 07:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439611, 334047, 55838, '<td valign="top">I don''t think Baby has anything to fear with you near!  This is a thing of beauty.  Brilliant.  Great light on the skin, focus, coloring, and emotion.  In my opinion the bars of light in the back take a little something away but I don''t care - a rare 10 from me.</td>', 'I don''t think Baby has anything to fear with you near!  This is a thing of beauty.  Brilliant.  Great light on the skin, focus, coloring, and emotion.  In my opinion the bars of light in the back take a little something away but I don''t care - a rare 10 from me.', '2006-05-20 07:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439612, 336248, 31794, '<td valign="top">hefur ekki beint lookið fyrir Titanic atriðið, en góð hugmynd samt ;)</td>', 'hefur ekki beint lookið fyrir Titanic atriðið, en góð hugmynd samt ;)', '2006-05-20 07:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439614, 334968, 36470, '<td valign="top">First of all, your composition is a 10.  I love how you framed yourself.  Some detractors are:<br/>-The hotspots on your forehead and nose.  It is an easy fix. (use your clone stamp tool at 50% opacity.  Use the DARKEN blend mode.  Alt-click on an area that is not ''hot'' and then go over the hot spot with a large, soft brush.)  <br/>-The white balance seems off.  The golden color works well for your hair, but is distracting for the whites of your eyes and your skin tone.  (Try going into CURVES.  Click the white eye-dropper.  Now click the eye dropper in the whitest part of your eye and see if that takes the yellow out.  OR, you can try using a cooling filter.<br/>-Also, try a little selective unsharp mask on your eye.<br/>-Kill or simplify your frame :)<br/> <br/>Of course, this is all just a matter of my opinion!  I really do like the potential of this image.  7</td>', 'First of all, your composition is a 10.  I love how you framed yourself.  Some detractors are:-The hotspots on your forehead and nose.  It is an easy fix. (use your clone stamp tool at 50% opacity.  Use the DARKEN blend mode.  Alt-click on an area that is not ''hot'' and then go over the hot spot with a large, soft brush.)  -The white balance seems off.  The golden color works well for your hair, but is distracting for the whites of your eyes and your skin tone.  (Try going into CURVES.  Click the white eye-dropper.  Now click the eye dropper in the whitest part of your eye and see if that takes the yellow out.  OR, you can try using a cooling filter.-Also, try a little selective unsharp mask on your eye.-Kill or simplify your frame :) Of course, this is all just a matter of my opinion!  I really do like the potential of this image.  7', '2006-05-20 07:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439615, 334877, 36470, '<td valign="top">I like your framing, but not the selective color.  I also like the gradient of your background.</td>', 'I like your framing, but not the selective color.  I also like the gradient of your background.', '2006-05-20 07:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439620, 335996, 35044, '<td valign="top">topical!</td>', 'topical!', '2006-05-20 07:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439621, 336268, 36470, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.  I like that your background is something other than a backdrop.  It adds nicely to the composition without being distracting.  Well done :)</td>', 'Love the lighting.  I like that your background is something other than a backdrop.  It adds nicely to the composition without being distracting.  Well done :)', '2006-05-20 07:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439625, 335951, 36470, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how you achieved this.  Very cool. 8</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how you achieved this.  Very cool. 8', '2006-05-20 07:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439626, 336408, 36470, '<td valign="top">Excellent character portrait.  Composition is excellent.</td>', 'Excellent character portrait.  Composition is excellent.', '2006-05-20 07:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439628, 333563, 36470, '<td valign="top">LOL, That takes guts.  I hate bugs!  Funny portrait :) 8</td>', 'LOL, That takes guts.  I hate bugs!  Funny portrait :) 8', '2006-05-20 07:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439635, 333865, 36470, '<td valign="top">Excellent creativity - Best of luck - 9</td>', 'Excellent creativity - Best of luck - 9', '2006-05-20 07:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439639, 333456, 42567, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  Good shot</td>', 'Very pretty!  Good shot', '2006-05-20 07:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439640, 335011, 42567, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  10</td>', 'I really like this!  10', '2006-05-20 07:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439641, 334765, 42567, '<td valign="top">Cool shot barbarian!!  10!</td>', 'Cool shot barbarian!!  10!', '2006-05-20 07:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439642, 335902, 42567, '<td valign="top">Cool shot Judi!!  One of my fav''s!</td>', 'Cool shot Judi!!  One of my fav''s!', '2006-05-20 07:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439644, 334968, 16912, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well executed - good luck (8)</td>', 'Great idea, well executed - good luck (8)', '2006-05-20 08:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439646, 333255, 16912, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I love negative space and it works well here with a great composition, the lighting really sets this shot off for me :)</td>', 'Great shot! I love negative space and it works well here with a great composition, the lighting really sets this shot off for me :)', '2006-05-20 08:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439654, 334829, 34192, '<td valign="top">You have such a beautiful face to be hiding behind the camera.  In photoshop you could have reversed this so the writing is not backwards (I find it distracting).  Tonal conversion good.  Image lacks drama but focused well. 7</td>', 'You have such a beautiful face to be hiding behind the camera.  In photoshop you could have reversed this so the writing is not backwards (I find it distracting).  Tonal conversion good.  Image lacks drama but focused well. 7', '2006-05-20 08:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439682, 336401, 56658, '<td valign="top">very good job. You almost nailed it. lighting is a little off. 9</td>', 'very good job. You almost nailed it. lighting is a little off. 9', '2006-05-20 08:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439684, 336397, 56658, '<td valign="top">good job. you should ahve gone the extra mile and shaved half of the beard. 9</td>', 'good job. you should ahve gone the extra mile and shaved half of the beard. 9', '2006-05-20 08:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439697, 336235, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great idea - the reflection gives a really ghostly effect.</td>', 'Great idea - the reflection gives a really ghostly effect.', '2006-05-20 09:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439698, 335773, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, clever idea, but oh! that distracting background.</td>', 'Nice portrait, clever idea, but oh! that distracting background.', '2006-05-20 09:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439702, 336156, 12733, '<td valign="top">Well done pose, lighting, textures. The tilt, which I assume is deliberate, is kind of disconcerting - is your left hand grabbing the ground to keep from sliding downhill?</td>', 'Well done pose, lighting, textures. The tilt, which I assume is deliberate, is kind of disconcerting - is your left hand grabbing the ground to keep from sliding downhill?', '2006-05-20 09:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439704, 335482, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is too deliberately cutesy for my taste, sorry.</td>', 'This is too deliberately cutesy for my taste, sorry.', '2006-05-20 09:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439705, 336403, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp rendition. The pose fits the title well.</td>', 'Nice, sharp rendition. The pose fits the title well.', '2006-05-20 09:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439708, 334858, 12733, '<td valign="top">The extreme closeup and cut off edges are effective - a reminder that less is more.</td>', 'The extreme closeup and cut off edges are effective - a reminder that less is more.', '2006-05-20 09:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439711, 335804, 12733, '<td valign="top">The high-key treatment is very effective, as is the cutoff at top and bottom.</td>', 'The high-key treatment is very effective, as is the cutoff at top and bottom.', '2006-05-20 09:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439712, 335377, 12733, '<td valign="top">The flowers and background bring out the dreamy effect well, but the graininess partly negates that effect.</td>', 'The flowers and background bring out the dreamy effect well, but the graininess partly negates that effect.', '2006-05-20 09:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439715, 336271, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very nice setting, well photographed. This picture does bring out the question: do you define yourself by your car? I agree it is a gorgeous restoration.</td>', 'A very nice setting, well photographed. This picture does bring out the question: do you define yourself by your car? I agree it is a gorgeous restoration.', '2006-05-20 09:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439716, 336080, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful landscape shot, and you fit yourself into it well.</td>', 'This is a beautiful landscape shot, and you fit yourself into it well.', '2006-05-20 09:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439717, 336288, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of high key!</td>', 'Very effective use of high key!', '2006-05-20 09:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439718, 333572, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wow! The sunrise (or sunset?) knocks me out, and your silhouette is well placed. I would generally consider a clear face an essential part of the definition of a portrait, but this is definitely an exception.</td>', 'Wow! The sunrise (or sunset?) knocks me out, and your silhouette is well placed. I would generally consider a clear face an essential part of the definition of a portrait, but this is definitely an exception.', '2006-05-20 09:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439719, 336046, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and focus on the background, but the portrait part is too dark to see.</td>', 'Great exposure and focus on the background, but the portrait part is too dark to see.', '2006-05-20 09:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439720, 336193, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice, tight composition and excellent sharpness.</td>', 'Nice, tight composition and excellent sharpness.', '2006-05-20 09:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439721, 335903, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and background behind you, an interesting and humorous pose. The lighting on you seems too bright for the background - is this fill flash??</td>', 'Nice lighting and background behind you, an interesting and humorous pose. The lighting on you seems too bright for the background - is this fill flash??', '2006-05-20 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439723, 336365, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition and a great idea. The focus on your face is a bit soft.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition and a great idea. The focus on your face is a bit soft.', '2006-05-20 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439725, 334047, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - the placement of the baby with its back to the camera puts the focus on your portrait.</td>', 'Nicely done - the placement of the baby with its back to the camera puts the focus on your portrait.', '2006-05-20 09:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439727, 334262, 12733, '<td valign="top">Clear, sharp photo. The red seems too dominant.</td>', 'Clear, sharp photo. The red seems too dominant.', '2006-05-20 09:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439729, 336261, 12733, '<td valign="top">The dark, low-key treatment creates a mood of sadness. If that was your intent, you did it very well.</td>', 'The dark, low-key treatment creates a mood of sadness. If that was your intent, you did it very well.', '2006-05-20 09:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439730, 336060, 12733, '<td valign="top">Clear, sharp and in your face.</td>', 'Clear, sharp and in your face.', '2006-05-20 09:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439732, 333465, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to create a close-up of your face that leaves the viewer not a clue as to what you really look like. It is a very effective photo though.</td>', 'You''ve managed to create a close-up of your face that leaves the viewer not a clue as to what you really look like. It is a very effective photo though.', '2006-05-20 09:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439734, 334759, 12733, '<td valign="top">The flowers framing your face are very effective. Great sharpness, lighting.</td>', 'The flowers framing your face are very effective. Great sharpness, lighting.', '2006-05-20 09:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439735, 333865, 46294, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!</td>', 'Cool idea!', '2006-05-20 09:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439736, 336243, 12733, '<td valign="top">But not photographic lighting. This is too deliberately cutesy for my taste, sorry.</td>', 'But not photographic lighting. This is too deliberately cutesy for my taste, sorry.', '2006-05-20 09:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439737, 336187, 12733, '<td valign="top">Sell this picture to Harley when the challenge is over. Nice effect, getting your back and still showing your face.</td>', 'Sell this picture to Harley when the challenge is over. Nice effect, getting your back and still showing your face.', '2006-05-20 09:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439740, 335672, 46294, '<td valign="top">I love it!!! Took me a while to find you, but realy great, 10</td>', 'I love it!!! Took me a while to find you, but realy great, 10', '2006-05-20 09:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439743, 333621, 12733, '<td valign="top">The high-key treatment almost works - but it should not be completely lost in the background.</td>', 'The high-key treatment almost works - but it should not be completely lost in the background.', '2006-05-20 09:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439744, 335510, 46294, '<td valign="top">There ar smuges in the background and a bit to low in contrast, too bad, because i like your pose.</td>', 'There ar smuges in the background and a bit to low in contrast, too bad, because i like your pose.', '2006-05-20 09:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439745, 335672, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting treatment of the challenge. The high-key foreground against to black background creates great contrast and shows detail. Your face could be sharper - it would be easier to pick if it were the sharpest of the lot.</td>', 'Interesting treatment of the challenge. The high-key foreground against to black background creates great contrast and shows detail. Your face could be sharper - it would be easier to pick if it were the sharpest of the lot.', '2006-05-20 09:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439746, 336261, 46294, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Nice tone! Nice lightning.</td>', 'Lovely. Nice tone! Nice lightning.', '2006-05-20 09:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439754, 335761, 12733, '<td valign="top">Abstracts don''t seem to fit in with a portrait challenge. I have seen abstracts made up of objects that the photographer feels describe him, but turning yourself into a red blob doesn''t make it for me, sorry.</td>', 'Abstracts don''t seem to fit in with a portrait challenge. I have seen abstracts made up of objects that the photographer feels describe him, but turning yourself into a red blob doesn''t make it for me, sorry.', '2006-05-20 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439755, 333592, 36470, '<td valign="top">A 10 the second I saw it.  Love this in every way.  A ribbon coming your way,.....or so I predict!</td>', 'A 10 the second I saw it.  Love this in every way.  A ribbon coming your way,.....or so I predict!', '2006-05-20 09:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439756, 336407, 36470, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.  My 2nd 10 of 66% rated.  Good luck!</td>', 'Outstanding.  My 2nd 10 of 66% rated.  Good luck!', '2006-05-20 09:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439757, 333949, 36470, '<td valign="top">Well done portrait.  I hope to see this in the top 5.  Good luck! 10</td>', 'Well done portrait.  I hope to see this in the top 5.  Good luck! 10', '2006-05-20 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439758, 336354, 12733, '<td valign="top">Effective separation of the dark hair from the background.</td>', 'Effective separation of the dark hair from the background.', '2006-05-20 09:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439759, 335672, 36470, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Creative and well executed. 10</td>', 'Love it.  Creative and well executed. 10', '2006-05-20 09:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439760, 335743, 12733, '<td valign="top">Amazing how much you can say with your eyes. Great sharp rendition and color, a very effective shot. In the picky-picky department, the small amount of uncovered neck tends to distract the eye from your face.</td>', 'Amazing how much you can say with your eyes. Great sharp rendition and color, a very effective shot. In the picky-picky department, the small amount of uncovered neck tends to distract the eye from your face.', '2006-05-20 09:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2439762, 335672, 56658, '<td valign="top">wonderfull.</td>', 'wonderfull.', '2006-05-20 09:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
