(2439764, 336407, 25355, '<td valign="top">Young Joey. I like how you restrained yourself with the editing (I mean, the grunge-look, which I''m not a great fan of). It''s taken me a long while to figure out what the translucent object is - I guess a dusty old piece of broken glass or perspex. Very good effort indeed.</td>', 'Young Joey. I like how you restrained yourself with the editing (I mean, the grunge-look, which I''m not a great fan of). It''s taken me a long while to figure out what the translucent object is - I guess a dusty old piece of broken glass or perspex. Very good effort indeed.', '2006-05-20 10:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
