(2440701, 336289, 21851, '<td valign="top">Having seen this "how we did it" I can say I appreciate it. However I''m not a fan of this much post editing in challenges. 8 for the shot -2 on the post editing not that the post editing is bad only because I have a personal problem with this much post editing being allowed... 6</td>', 'Having seen this "how we did it" I can say I appreciate it. However I''m not a fan of this much post editing in challenges. 8 for the shot -2 on the post editing not that the post editing is bad only because I have a personal problem with this much post editing being allowed... 6', '2006-05-20 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440703, 335377, 21851, '<td valign="top">Good shot here and I would have scored it 9-10 although I''m having a problem buying that it was a "Self Portrait" 6</td>', 'Good shot here and I would have scored it 9-10 although I''m having a problem buying that it was a "Self Portrait" 6', '2006-05-20 15:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440705, 335855, 5728, '<td valign="top">Look at the front of the frame on your shirt and that is where the camera has focused. It always happens to me when I do a self portrait too, my eyes are just wonky so I can never get the focus on my eyes properly :) You could have saved this a little in the PP phase by selecting the eyes, or eye in this case, and sharpening it up a bit, also maybe bringing in a little more brightness into the eye white. Lighting is good, the cross from shadows to highlights is both smooth and at the same time extreme, good work there. But like I said the main focal point is on the shirt. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Look at the front of the frame on your shirt and that is where the camera has focused. It always happens to me when I do a self portrait too, my eyes are just wonky so I can never get the focus on my eyes properly :) You could have saved this a little in the PP phase by selecting the eyes, or eye in this case, and sharpening it up a bit, also maybe bringing in a little more brightness into the eye white. Lighting is good, the cross from shadows to highlights is both smooth and at the same time extreme, good work there. But like I said the main focal point is on the shirt. Thanks for sharing.', '2006-05-20 16:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440707, 335804, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice high tones, shadows are very noisy.  The cut on the hair doesn''t feel right.  Perhaps some more space at the top or a tighter crop would work better.</td>', 'Nice high tones, shadows are very noisy.  The cut on the hair doesn''t feel right.  Perhaps some more space at the top or a tighter crop would work better.', '2006-05-20 16:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440712, 336354, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the gesture and the composition.  BW work is very good.  I think some toning down of the fingers would make this better.</td>', 'I like the gesture and the composition.  BW work is very good.  I think some toning down of the fingers would make this better.', '2006-05-20 16:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440713, 336409, 24642, '<td valign="top">Classic straightforward shot.  Good work.</td>', 'Classic straightforward shot.  Good work.', '2006-05-20 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440785, 336253, 24642, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and tones.  The title reminds me of a great Peter Gabriel song that I like, the text of the song fits the mood of the photo.  Good work.</td>', 'I really like the light and tones.  The title reminds me of a great Peter Gabriel song that I like, the text of the song fits the mood of the photo.  Good work.', '2006-05-20 17:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2440789, 336164, 24642, '<td valign="top">You get the mood across.  The tones are wonderful.<br/>I like the post processing and the lighting.  The composition is interesting.</td>', 'You get the mood across.  The tones are wonderful.I like the post processing and the lighting.  The composition is interesting.', '2006-05-20 17:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
