(2441566, 333466, 11518, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  Would have been a lot better earlier in the morning or at dusk when the light is less harsh.  Looks like it was taken at noon, with no shadows showing. It''s the interplay of light and shadows that makes a photo appealing and have a wow factor.  Also looks oversharpened and there''s a white "Nike" streak on the coat from ?over-dodging or ?jpg compression.  Hope this helps for your next entries.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  Would have been a lot better earlier in the morning or at dusk when the light is less harsh.  Looks like it was taken at noon, with no shadows showing. It''s the interplay of light and shadows that makes a photo appealing and have a wow factor.  Also looks oversharpened and there''s a white "Nike" streak on the coat from ?over-dodging or ?jpg compression.  Hope this helps for your next entries.', '2006-05-20 22:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
