(2441662, 335761, 50695, '<td valign="top">30 minutes of your life. you were overgenerous and end up giving us just a ball of light. but what can we really know of a person anyway? at least here we sense that we''ve shared something with you, even if ignorantly. A profound statement on the limitations of the observer. 8.</td>', '30 minutes of your life. you were overgenerous and end up giving us just a ball of light. but what can we really know of a person anyway? at least here we sense that we''ve shared something with you, even if ignorantly. A profound statement on the limitations of the observer. 8.', '2006-05-20 23:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441663, 335122, 52731, '<td valign="top">Oh my...this kind of looks like low budget porn. For a nude to work as art, some attention has to be paid to lighting, composition, etc....oh dear.</td>', 'Oh my...this kind of looks like low budget porn. For a nude to work as art, some attention has to be paid to lighting, composition, etc....oh dear.', '2006-05-20 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441664, 335429, 50695, '<td valign="top">I for one appreciate the grain. I''m sure you''re taking a hit for it. I''m taking a huge hit for my blur effect. This is an example of a gimmick that is so good it transforms into art. I feel like I am both standing outside of you and standing inside your camera at the same time. In fact, I also feel like I''m standing in your moccasins.</td>', 'I for one appreciate the grain. I''m sure you''re taking a hit for it. I''m taking a huge hit for my blur effect. This is an example of a gimmick that is so good it transforms into art. I feel like I am both standing outside of you and standing inside your camera at the same time. In fact, I also feel like I''m standing in your moccasins.', '2006-05-20 23:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2441665, 334687, 55746, '<td valign="top">Thank you!</td>', 'Thank you!', '2006-05-20 23:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
