(2442178, 335784, 35786, '<td valign="top">this is really interesting- the image itself is grainy (which is not necessarily a bad thing!) and your face seems to be a bit off focus but I''m really digging this!!! I almost want to see a bit of motion blur on the side of your face for some reason. I had to play with it in PS so feel free to PM me if you want to see what I mean. the glass reflection might be an unknown distraction too- didn''t notice it untill I opened it in PS. I love it- looks like a candid. I have to give you a 9. well done.</td>', 'this is really interesting- the image itself is grainy (which is not necessarily a bad thing!) and your face seems to be a bit off focus but I''m really digging this!!! I almost want to see a bit of motion blur on the side of your face for some reason. I had to play with it in PS so feel free to PM me if you want to see what I mean. the glass reflection might be an unknown distraction too- didn''t notice it untill I opened it in PS. I love it- looks like a candid. I have to give you a 9. well done.', '2006-05-21 03:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
