(2443291, 335351, 40679, '<td valign="top">I used to play ballet when I was 11 years old.. every lesson there was a man behind the piano, and I even can still remember what the name of my teacher was... good old times ;)<br/> <br/>when I look at your photo, you look like one of the big girls in the ballet-school I looked up to. They were beautiful with the pointes and their clothes. I''ve never danced on pointes, but that was a dream of mine. Still, when I see them, I have to think about that time.<br/> <br/>you''re in the middle of the photo, normally it would be "boring" but you''ve managed to take a shot that''s so stunning, it doesn''t matter where you are in the photo.. the look on your face is fantastic, just like the pose you''re in. <br/> <br/>this is a 10 and I''m gonna add you to my faves. sorry for the background story, hope you can appreciate it :)</td>', 'I used to play ballet when I was 11 years old.. every lesson there was a man behind the piano, and I even can still remember what the name of my teacher was... good old times ;) when I look at your photo, you look like one of the big girls in the ballet-school I looked up to. They were beautiful with the pointes and their clothes. I''ve never danced on pointes, but that was a dream of mine. Still, when I see them, I have to think about that time. you''re in the middle of the photo, normally it would be "boring" but you''ve managed to take a shot that''s so stunning, it doesn''t matter where you are in the photo.. the look on your face is fantastic, just like the pose you''re in.  this is a 10 and I''m gonna add you to my faves. sorry for the background story, hope you can appreciate it :)', '2006-05-21 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
