(2443621, 336185, 36141, '<td valign="top">You have a very expressive face Biteme (I recognize you from other challenges) and I like your style in photography and creativity. I gave you a 9, which is the highest score I give and that''s not because you''re Dutch too. I never give 10''s because I like to think that nobody''s perfect.</td>', 'You have a very expressive face Biteme (I recognize you from other challenges) and I like your style in photography and creativity. I gave you a 9, which is the highest score I give and that''s not because you''re Dutch too. I never give 10''s because I like to think that nobody''s perfect.', '2006-05-21 18:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
