(2443640, 336210, 36141, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen you around, but don''t have the time to look up your name.<br/>I think this is a wonderful portrait. I''m not qualified to judge technique at all, but it just jumped at me. Maybe it''s the colours, the pose, the look, who knows. I gave you my highest score 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.</td>', 'I''ve seen you around, but don''t have the time to look up your name.I think this is a wonderful portrait. I''m not qualified to judge technique at all, but it just jumped at me. Maybe it''s the colours, the pose, the look, who knows. I gave you my highest score 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.', '2006-05-21 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443658, 336400, 36141, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen you around, but don''t have the time to look up your name. This is a gorgeous portrait and I think it tells a lot about who you are. I think you''re a positive thinker with a lot of humor (hope I''m right) I like to see the texture of skin which, alas, is so often killed by too much use of NI. I gave you my highest score 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen you around, but don''t have the time to look up your name. This is a gorgeous portrait and I think it tells a lot about who you are. I think you''re a positive thinker with a lot of humor (hope I''m right) I like to see the texture of skin which, alas, is so often killed by too much use of NI. I gave you my highest score 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.', '2006-05-21 18:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443664, 336407, 36141, '<td valign="top">Don''t know you, but this self portrait is just beautiful, by colour, style and composition. I gave you my highest score 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.</td>', 'Don''t know you, but this self portrait is just beautiful, by colour, style and composition. I gave you my highest score 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.', '2006-05-21 18:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443669, 336232, 36141, '<td valign="top">LOL I like your humor. Many will probably say your photo is not sharp enough, but I don''t mind at all. I gave you 8.</td>', 'LOL I like your humor. Many will probably say your photo is not sharp enough, but I don''t mind at all. I gave you 8.', '2006-05-21 19:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443682, 336362, 36141, '<td valign="top">I rated you 8 first, but at second look I''ll make it a 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.<br/>I like your portrait very much, it''s plain, simple and true, if those are the right words. Good lightening too and a beautiful B&amp;W, which colour suits portraits very well.</td>', 'I rated you 8 first, but at second look I''ll make it a 9. I don''t give 10''s because 10 is the ultimate and I like to think that nobody''s perfect.I like your portrait very much, it''s plain, simple and true, if those are the right words. Good lightening too and a beautiful B&W, which colour suits portraits very well.', '2006-05-21 19:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443684, 335679, 36141, '<td valign="top">Your portrait makes me think Eastern countries, probably by the silver bands on your arms, India or Pakistan or somewhere in that area (probably wrong guess) Very intriging and nice colours. I gave you 8.</td>', 'Your portrait makes me think Eastern countries, probably by the silver bands on your arms, India or Pakistan or somewhere in that area (probably wrong guess) Very intriging and nice colours. I gave you 8.', '2006-05-21 19:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
