(2443847, 334933, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the photo extend vertically so your hair isn''t cut off. Also, too many blown highlights on your face.</td>', 'I would like to see the photo extend vertically so your hair isn''t cut off. Also, too many blown highlights on your face.', '2006-05-21 19:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443850, 335859, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the shadows are too harsh.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the shadows are too harsh.', '2006-05-21 19:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2443854, 336041, 55642, '<td valign="top">The neat details here are that you''re barefoot and your jeans are cuffed. For some reason I really like this. But I wish you would have put more thought into your expression.</td>', 'The neat details here are that you''re barefoot and your jeans are cuffed. For some reason I really like this. But I wish you would have put more thought into your expression.', '2006-05-21 19:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
