(2444960, 336287, 55621, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I gave this a 3, and thought I should at least tell you why.  To me this challenge is about self creativity, not just looking into your camera and making a funny face. Your image might be visual but in the over all scope, it lacks a level of imagination.</td>', 'Sorry but I gave this a 3, and thought I should at least tell you why.  To me this challenge is about self creativity, not just looking into your camera and making a funny face. Your image might be visual but in the over all scope, it lacks a level of imagination.', '2006-05-22 00:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
