(2444968, 335526, 11843, '<td valign="top">Really good tension created by the proximity to the knives! Lighting is a bit harsh, but thats a bit nit picky. Great work.</td>', 'Really good tension created by the proximity to the knives! Lighting is a bit harsh, but thats a bit nit picky. Great work.', '2006-05-22 00:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
