(2445007, 333467, 11843, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Good light. I like the way the tail frames your eye. Good work.</td>', 'Cool idea. Good light. I like the way the tail frames your eye. Good work.', '2006-05-22 00:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
