(2447464, 336388, 27735, '<td valign="top">Hey, Rikki!!!</td>', 'Hey, Rikki!!!', '2006-05-22 19:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447465, 335951, 20941, '<td valign="top">this is a 10!</td>', 'this is a 10!', '2006-05-22 19:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447524, 335672, 57882, '<td valign="top">You are a creative genius.  Great concept and great execution.  I think you''ve got this challenge wrapped up. 10 from me.</td>', 'You are a creative genius.  Great concept and great execution.  I think you''ve got this challenge wrapped up. 10 from me.', '2006-05-22 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447601, 335011, 6388, '<td valign="top">K i''m finally back for the real comment.  what i was going to say was that I thought your editing has improved over the years.  I recognized you right away, but you have made an interesting metamorphosis since back in the early days when your only comment about your SPs was that they made your nose look big. :)<br/> <br/>one of the things i''m beginning to dig about portrait photography that seems to have taken me forever to figure out, is that you get the chance to become someone you''re not - you can tell a story via the image, and there''s no need to back it up or validate it. (if I''d been paying attention earlier I could have learned this looking at the works of people like Alecia, Kiwi, and Nasti...but i''m not all that perceptive it seems).   So even though the setup of this is very similar to the last SP challenge with your high-key (then) new red hair, the two shots have very distinct looks, and that my dear is cool.<br/> <br/>so good on ya.  keep working on the processing...it''ll come over time.<br/> <br/>P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-26 23:48:15.</i></td>', 'K i''m finally back for the real comment.  what i was going to say was that I thought your editing has improved over the years.  I recognized you right away, but you have made an interesting metamorphosis since back in the early days when your only comment about your SPs was that they made your nose look big. :) one of the things i''m beginning to dig about portrait photography that seems to have taken me forever to figure out, is that you get the chance to become someone you''re not - you can tell a story via the image, and there''s no need to back it up or validate it. (if I''d been paying attention earlier I could have learned this looking at the works of people like Alecia, Kiwi, and Nasti...but i''m not all that perceptive it seems).   So even though the setup of this is very similar to the last SP challenge with your high-key (then) new red hair, the two shots have very distinct looks, and that my dear is cool. so good on ya.  keep working on the processing...it''ll come over time. P', '2006-05-22 20:31:57.000000', '2006-05-27 00:48:15.000000', 1),
(2447674, 336350, 40667, '<td valign="top">got face? I like your interpritation, but imo the idea of a portrait is to see ur wonderful features, so show''em! Creative tho</td>', 'got face? I like your interpritation, but imo the idea of a portrait is to see ur wonderful features, so show''em! Creative tho', '2006-05-22 20:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447679, 335743, 56135, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-05-22 21:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447686, 335859, 40667, '<td valign="top">Really great idea! Wish you could have had more of an easil type set up to get more of an artsy feeling ( easil- did i spell that right?) Anyway, Something that we could see your great work, and face! From what i see, You would have looked great in a simple full face portrait, and with advanced editing, you could have gone any way with it. Nice job tho</td>', 'Really great idea! Wish you could have had more of an easil type set up to get more of an artsy feeling ( easil- did i spell that right?) Anyway, Something that we could see your great work, and face! From what i see, You would have looked great in a simple full face portrait, and with advanced editing, you could have gone any way with it. Nice job tho', '2006-05-22 21:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447692, 333943, 40667, '<td valign="top">Really appealing! love it, i think u''ll do great with this one! good luck!</td>', 'Really appealing! love it, i think u''ll do great with this one! good luck!', '2006-05-22 21:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447833, 335996, 45579, '<td valign="top">honestly this one is cool.</td>', 'honestly this one is cool.', '2006-05-22 22:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447847, 336239, 58235, '<td valign="top">thats awesome</td>', 'thats awesome', '2006-05-22 22:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447852, 336232, 27767, '<td valign="top">This shot cracks me up. I like the expression and I think the messy hair works very well. The sharp and colorful eyes, plus the catchlights command my attention.</td>', 'This shot cracks me up. I like the expression and I think the messy hair works very well. The sharp and colorful eyes, plus the catchlights command my attention.', '2006-05-22 22:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447870, 335456, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think this concept is great, though I would be interested to see different framing and lighting. The negative space behind the head makes the shot feel very off balance to me, especially with the main facial features leaning heavily on the left border. The lighting seems a little harsh to me.  I think that a softer lighting setup would maintain fine detail in the blown out skin areas and reduce the contrast nicely. I do like the makeup and the catchlights in both eyes.</td>', 'I think this concept is great, though I would be interested to see different framing and lighting. The negative space behind the head makes the shot feel very off balance to me, especially with the main facial features leaning heavily on the left border. The lighting seems a little harsh to me.  I think that a softer lighting setup would maintain fine detail in the blown out skin areas and reduce the contrast nicely. I do like the makeup and the catchlights in both eyes.', '2006-05-22 22:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447878, 333255, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot and the bright lighting. The grey vertical lines on the left side of the shot are a little distracting to me, but I like the stripes created on your shoulder and face.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot and the bright lighting. The grey vertical lines on the left side of the shot are a little distracting to me, but I like the stripes created on your shoulder and face.', '2006-05-22 22:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447888, 336024, 27767, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept. I like the expression on your face and the hand pulling back the shower curtain. The shampoo suds over your eye are great too. The lighting is good, though I wish there was a catchlight in your right eye.</td>', 'This is a great concept. I like the expression on your face and the hand pulling back the shower curtain. The shampoo suds over your eye are great too. The lighting is good, though I wish there was a catchlight in your right eye.', '2006-05-22 22:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447892, 336395, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the dark feeling to this shot. Your eyes are wonderful, and their detail and color really hold my attention. The catchlights are great, and the lighting across your face is nice and smooth. I like the background and dark border (inside the white border) to the image.</td>', 'I like the dark feeling to this shot. Your eyes are wonderful, and their detail and color really hold my attention. The catchlights are great, and the lighting across your face is nice and smooth. I like the background and dark border (inside the white border) to the image.', '2006-05-22 22:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447902, 335510, 27767, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything really wrong with the shot, but it isn''t quite grabbing my attention. The lighting is fine, though I wish there were a small catchlight in the eyes. The composition is fine, and I like how it isn''t dead centered on you (which could make it a little too static). I''m not sure what to think about the coloring. It seems like a dark copper duotone, but could be achieved other ways. I think a straight black and white would be great as long as the histogram was pushed all the way to pure black and pure white.</td>', 'I don''t see anything really wrong with the shot, but it isn''t quite grabbing my attention. The lighting is fine, though I wish there were a small catchlight in the eyes. The composition is fine, and I like how it isn''t dead centered on you (which could make it a little too static). I''m not sure what to think about the coloring. It seems like a dark copper duotone, but could be achieved other ways. I think a straight black and white would be great as long as the histogram was pushed all the way to pure black and pure white.', '2006-05-22 22:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447908, 336344, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of this shot. Both your skin and stubble are in sharp focus.  I like the lighting. The shadows are not too underexposed, and the highlights are still holding detail. The composition is good and I like the border. Looks like it has a nice full tone range. I like that neither eye is in shadow too.</td>', 'I like the texture of this shot. Both your skin and stubble are in sharp focus.  I like the lighting. The shadows are not too underexposed, and the highlights are still holding detail. The composition is good and I like the border. Looks like it has a nice full tone range. I like that neither eye is in shadow too.', '2006-05-22 22:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447915, 335743, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and I like the title. I think the lighting is good overall, though strangely enough, the ring looking catchlights are slightly more distracting than normal shaped catchlights to me. Good background color and DOF as well.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and I like the title. I think the lighting is good overall, though strangely enough, the ring looking catchlights are slightly more distracting than normal shaped catchlights to me. Good background color and DOF as well.', '2006-05-22 22:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447926, 335519, 27767, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept here. I think there is too much black space at the bottom, which is much less interesting than the gorgeous sky in this case. The silohuette is nice and the orange and blue of the sunset (?) are great.</td>', 'Excellent concept here. I think there is too much black space at the bottom, which is much less interesting than the gorgeous sky in this case. The silohuette is nice and the orange and blue of the sunset (?) are great.', '2006-05-22 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447932, 336316, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good solid portrait. I like the composition placing the tree almost at the edge (but not off), and your face out of the dead center. Good color and detail in the eyes (were they dodged a little?) along with nice smooth overall lighting.</td>', 'Good solid portrait. I like the composition placing the tree almost at the edge (but not off), and your face out of the dead center. Good color and detail in the eyes (were they dodged a little?) along with nice smooth overall lighting.', '2006-05-22 22:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447942, 335713, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the boldness of this shot. The masterful DOF keeps your eyes in razor sharp focus while softly blurring the rest of the image. The dots on your face work well with the color of the fabric. My only little complaint is the white polka dots in the fabric are somewhat busy and distracting compared to the less busy plain white face. Good catchlights in your eyes.</td>', 'I like the boldness of this shot. The masterful DOF keeps your eyes in razor sharp focus while softly blurring the rest of the image. The dots on your face work well with the color of the fabric. My only little complaint is the white polka dots in the fabric are somewhat busy and distracting compared to the less busy plain white face. Good catchlights in your eyes.', '2006-05-22 22:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447949, 333769, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the soft lighting and casual pose. The catchlights in your eyes are good and the lighting of your hair really makes it glow nicely. Good composition and DOF.</td>', 'I like the soft lighting and casual pose. The catchlights in your eyes are good and the lighting of your hair really makes it glow nicely. Good composition and DOF.', '2006-05-22 22:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447958, 336028, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of this shot overall. I think the shadows on your face created by the light down in front create sortof a menacing feel (which is good if that is what you were going for). I like the symmetrical composition and I think this works very well in black and white.</td>', 'I like the lighting of this shot overall. I think the shadows on your face created by the light down in front create sortof a menacing feel (which is good if that is what you were going for). I like the symmetrical composition and I think this works very well in black and white.', '2006-05-22 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447961, 335250, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the facial expression and action in this shot :) I hope others don''t ding you for the motion blur ''cause I think it adds to the lighthearted feel of the shot.</td>', 'I like the facial expression and action in this shot :) I hope others don''t ding you for the motion blur ''cause I think it adds to the lighthearted feel of the shot.', '2006-05-22 22:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447967, 335951, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot a lot. The lighting is great and the background is fantastic. The composition works well and I like the direct gaze into the camera. Great body pose as well.</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot a lot. The lighting is great and the background is fantastic. The composition works well and I like the direct gaze into the camera. Great body pose as well.', '2006-05-22 22:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447980, 334740, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good light and detail.</td>', 'Good light and detail.', '2006-05-22 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447981, 336164, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot a lot. I like the facial expression and catchlights in both eyes. Good soft lighting. One thing that I''m not enthusiastic about is the yellowish tint to your skin and the background almost give a sickly feel to the shot. I think that going black and white would look great. There also appears to be some significant noise in specific parts of the shot. I think this is ok, though it almost makes it look like it was taken with a low resolution camera since it lacks a sharp focus.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot a lot. I like the facial expression and catchlights in both eyes. Good soft lighting. One thing that I''m not enthusiastic about is the yellowish tint to your skin and the background almost give a sickly feel to the shot. I think that going black and white would look great. There also appears to be some significant noise in specific parts of the shot. I think this is ok, though it almost makes it look like it was taken with a low resolution camera since it lacks a sharp focus.', '2006-05-22 22:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447985, 336239, 18191, '<td valign="top">Well done.. took me a while to get it!</td>', 'Well done.. took me a while to get it!', '2006-05-22 22:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447986, 336046, 11843, '<td valign="top">A little dark on my screen. Composition is right in the center, maybe offset this a little to help. Focus looks like its on the growth in the background. Its tough to get good focus when you are in front of the camera. Nice work.</td>', 'A little dark on my screen. Composition is right in the center, maybe offset this a little to help. Focus looks like its on the growth in the background. Its tough to get good focus when you are in front of the camera. Nice work.', '2006-05-22 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447991, 333949, 11843, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and good focus! Good tones and interesting pose. Great work.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and good focus! Good tones and interesting pose. Great work.', '2006-05-22 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447994, 336066, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this composition and the lighting isn''t too harsh. I wish that the DOF were much more shallow so the field wasn''t so sharp in focus.</td>', 'I like this composition and the lighting isn''t too harsh. I wish that the DOF were much more shallow so the field wasn''t so sharp in focus.', '2006-05-22 22:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447996, 336287, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good light and details, although it looks a bit over sharpened in spots. Good composition. Good work.</td>', 'Good light and details, although it looks a bit over sharpened in spots. Good composition. Good work.', '2006-05-22 23:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2447997, 336280, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think the concept for this shot is great. The focus seems to be about 1 inch closer to the camera than your eyes, so they are not in real sharp focus. This is my only real complaint. The color is great and the lighting is good. The catchlights in your eyes look good.</td>', 'I think the concept for this shot is great. The focus seems to be about 1 inch closer to the camera than your eyes, so they are not in real sharp focus. This is my only real complaint. The color is great and the lighting is good. The catchlights in your eyes look good.', '2006-05-22 23:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448003, 335784, 11843, '<td valign="top">Tough to get good focus with such a large object right in the way. Thumbs up for originality though. Good tones and composition. Good work.</td>', 'Tough to get good focus with such a large object right in the way. Thumbs up for originality though. Good tones and composition. Good work.', '2006-05-22 23:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448004, 334696, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of this shot. The catchlight in your left eye is good, though wish there were one in your right eye too. The composition is great and the focus is too.</td>', 'I like the lighting of this shot. The catchlight in your left eye is good, though wish there were one in your right eye too. The composition is great and the focus is too.', '2006-05-22 23:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448014, 335351, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot, and I think the black and white works well to further that simplicity. The focus is great and the exposure is perfect in what appears to be a tough exposure situation.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot, and I think the black and white works well to further that simplicity. The focus is great and the exposure is perfect in what appears to be a tough exposure situation.', '2006-05-22 23:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448019, 335022, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF in this shot. The focus on your eyes is very good and the catchlights are great. I like the composition and full tone range.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF in this shot. The focus on your eyes is very good and the catchlights are great. I like the composition and full tone range.', '2006-05-22 23:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448020, 335103, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and light. Well done.</td>', 'Nice perspective and light. Well done.', '2006-05-22 23:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448024, 335659, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good composition and details.</td>', 'Good composition and details.', '2006-05-22 23:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448026, 334596, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great concept here. I like the simplicity of the composition and the lighting is very good. The black background works very well to isolate the subject. Great photo which is being held upside down too.</td>', 'Great concept here. I like the simplicity of the composition and the lighting is very good. The black background works very well to isolate the subject. Great photo which is being held upside down too.', '2006-05-22 23:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448027, 336324, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very good light and detail(focus). In this case I think I would have cloned or darkened out your shirt collar. Its a bit distracting. Well done.</td>', 'Very good light and detail(focus). In this case I think I would have cloned or darkened out your shirt collar. Its a bit distracting. Well done.', '2006-05-22 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448031, 336349, 11843, '<td valign="top">Funny!! This photo has a bit of a yellow tinge on my screen. A tighter crop that is off center a little could help the composition. Good detail in the eyes and good expression. Good work.</td>', 'Funny!! This photo has a bit of a yellow tinge on my screen. A tighter crop that is off center a little could help the composition. Good detail in the eyes and good expression. Good work.', '2006-05-22 23:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448033, 334968, 27767, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept. I really like the glowing gold of your hair, though the skin tones are a little too yellow for my taste. The focus on the hair is good too. Your eye looks like it is a tiny bit out of focus. I would prefer the eye be in sharp focus and the hair in softer focus.</td>', 'Excellent concept. I really like the glowing gold of your hair, though the skin tones are a little too yellow for my taste. The focus on the hair is good too. Your eye looks like it is a tiny bit out of focus. I would prefer the eye be in sharp focus and the hair in softer focus.', '2006-05-22 23:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448038, 335916, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. The catchlights in your eyes are good too. I like this shot in black and white.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. The catchlights in your eyes are good too. I like this shot in black and white.', '2006-05-22 23:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448039, 333465, 11843, '<td valign="top">Amazing eyes!! They really pop with color. I wish the glitter was a little brighter. Nice work.</td>', 'Amazing eyes!! They really pop with color. I wish the glitter was a little brighter. Nice work.', '2006-05-22 23:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448041, 335103, 27767, '<td valign="top">This shot feels very classy in black and white. I like the tilted composition a lot and the focus is superb. The catchlights in your eyes are great. I like how your glasses rest down on your nose and you are looking up into the camera.</td>', 'This shot feels very classy in black and white. I like the tilted composition a lot and the focus is superb. The catchlights in your eyes are great. I like how your glasses rest down on your nose and you are looking up into the camera.', '2006-05-22 23:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448043, 336066, 11843, '<td valign="top">Good light and detail. I think I would have cropped out the part of your arm that shows through your blouse and some off the right. Well done.</td>', 'Good light and detail. I think I would have cropped out the part of your arm that shows through your blouse and some off the right. Well done.', '2006-05-22 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448049, 334759, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very good detail, light and color! The composition is a bit off imo. Maybe crop off the lilly that is unopened off the right to get a bit off-center. Beautiful detail in the eyes! Great work.</td>', 'Very good detail, light and color! The composition is a bit off imo. Maybe crop off the lilly that is unopened off the right to get a bit off-center. Beautiful detail in the eyes! Great work.', '2006-05-22 23:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448051, 335351, 11843, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting! Good tones and detail. Well done.</td>', 'Nice backlighting! Good tones and detail. Well done.', '2006-05-22 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448068, 335764, 11843, '<td valign="top">Lighting and color are good! <br/>That bit of chair or whatever on the bottom right is a bit distracting, I''d clone it out. Also, what you can see of your hand just isn''t enough, its a distraction. Maybe you could have grabbed the front of you very cool hat to show more of your hand. The way your shoulder and arm go out of the left side of the frame doesn''t quite work for me, maybe if you could have caught your arm all the way out to your elbow.</td>', 'Lighting and color are good! That bit of chair or whatever on the bottom right is a bit distracting, I''d clone it out. Also, what you can see of your hand just isn''t enough, its a distraction. Maybe you could have grabbed the front of you very cool hat to show more of your hand. The way your shoulder and arm go out of the left side of the frame doesn''t quite work for me, maybe if you could have caught your arm all the way out to your elbow.', '2006-05-22 23:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448070, 336158, 11843, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea.', '2006-05-22 23:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448074, 335306, 11843, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and expression! Not so sure I like that yellow cast though. I would like to see this in B&amp;W. Great work.</td>', 'Excellent detail and expression! Not so sure I like that yellow cast though. I would like to see this in B&W. Great work.', '2006-05-22 23:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448076, 335657, 11843, '<td valign="top">It will be interesting to see how you took this! Very original.</td>', 'It will be interesting to see how you took this! Very original.', '2006-05-22 23:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2448082, 336338, 11843, '<td valign="top">Excellent light and interesting pose. I think you could spare some of that dark area on the right. I''d cut 1/4 of the image off the right. Very good detail too. Good work.</td>', 'Excellent light and interesting pose. I think you could spare some of that dark area on the right. I''d cut 1/4 of the image off the right. Very good detail too. Good work.', '2006-05-22 23:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
