(2448650, 336333, 39349, '<td valign="top">Roxanne? What a wonderful and beautiful portrait! Lighting IMHO might be a tad too harsh. I do like your pose and intense focus. Your eyes draw the viewer to attention and hold them there. I like your choice of background, it enhances this awesome photo but doesn''t overpower it. Well done girl!</td>', 'Roxanne? What a wonderful and beautiful portrait! Lighting IMHO might be a tad too harsh. I do like your pose and intense focus. Your eyes draw the viewer to attention and hold them there. I like your choice of background, it enhances this awesome photo but doesn''t overpower it. Well done girl!', '2006-05-23 03:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
