(2448654, 336308, 39349, '<td valign="top">My first, second and third impression of this photo was WOW! This shot just sets me back in my seat. Where do I begin? Ah yes, your eyes, MAGNIFICANT is one word that comes to mind. Amazing detail and sharpness that just demands attention. I also love the sepia tones you''ve chosen to use here. Very flattering, gives this a soft warm old world feel to this shot. <br/> <br/>I also love how you''ve given the viewer you, not a plastic neat-imaged version, I think that really sets this one apart from the rest of the crowd. You should be VERY proud of this shot! Bumping up and adding to favs.<br/> <br/>Bravo!</td>', 'My first, second and third impression of this photo was WOW! This shot just sets me back in my seat. Where do I begin? Ah yes, your eyes, MAGNIFICANT is one word that comes to mind. Amazing detail and sharpness that just demands attention. I also love the sepia tones you''ve chosen to use here. Very flattering, gives this a soft warm old world feel to this shot.  I also love how you''ve given the viewer you, not a plastic neat-imaged version, I think that really sets this one apart from the rest of the crowd. You should be VERY proud of this shot! Bumping up and adding to favs. Bravo!', '2006-05-23 03:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
