(2449570, 336028, 20530, '<td valign="top">Ahh, Steve...I thought this guy looked familiar, but I wouldn''t have figured it out if not for your very kind comment on mine! The intense gaze, the hands, forward leaning pose and the tatoos all make for a powerful and compelling composition. Nice contrast, and sharp focus. The BG blur is a little rough around the edges; but I couldn''t have done any better. I tried on mine and finally gave up. Very nice image!</td>', 'Ahh, Steve...I thought this guy looked familiar, but I wouldn''t have figured it out if not for your very kind comment on mine! The intense gaze, the hands, forward leaning pose and the tatoos all make for a powerful and compelling composition. Nice contrast, and sharp focus. The BG blur is a little rough around the edges; but I couldn''t have done any better. I tried on mine and finally gave up. Very nice image!', '2006-05-23 12:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
