(2450841, 335257, 42005, '<td valign="top">This is very emotive.   From the thumbnail, the bricks in the wall look like a cross which set a mood before opening.  It is a lovely lovey image, even if a tad dark in mood. I think the latter is what really captured me before the exquisite beauty of the two individuals.  10</td>', 'This is very emotive.   From the thumbnail, the bricks in the wall look like a cross which set a mood before opening.  It is a lovely lovey image, even if a tad dark in mood. I think the latter is what really captured me before the exquisite beauty of the two individuals.  10', '2006-05-23 20:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
