(2450936, 336040, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the wideangle distortion to this shot. The colors are great and the composition is strong. The placement of yourself within the frame is good since you are looking out into the rest of the frame.</td>', 'I really like the wideangle distortion to this shot. The colors are great and the composition is strong. The placement of yourself within the frame is good since you are looking out into the rest of the frame.', '2006-05-23 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450939, 334829, 27767, '<td valign="top">Humorous concept for this challenge.  I like the close crop, and I think black and white works well. Your face is in sharp focus, though I''d like the camera to be as well since it would provide extra interesting detail.</td>', 'Humorous concept for this challenge.  I like the close crop, and I think black and white works well. Your face is in sharp focus, though I''d like the camera to be as well since it would provide extra interesting detail.', '2006-05-23 21:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450942, 336076, 27767, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. I like the white background and how it sets off the subject. The eyes are captivating and the catchlights are good. The shot has a pastey feel (that I''m not too enthusiastic about) which may be intruduced by the post processing. I like the composition and the overall focus is great.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. I like the white background and how it sets off the subject. The eyes are captivating and the catchlights are good. The shot has a pastey feel (that I''m not too enthusiastic about) which may be intruduced by the post processing. I like the composition and the overall focus is great.', '2006-05-23 21:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450943, 333592, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this unique composition. I think the lighting works well and I like how the eyes are looking up into the empty space.</td>', 'I like this unique composition. I think the lighting works well and I like how the eyes are looking up into the empty space.', '2006-05-23 21:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450944, 336392, 27767, '<td valign="top">I wish the shot weren''t quite so dark because I think the idea works. The glint in your right eye helps, though I think too much detail has been lost to the shadows.</td>', 'I wish the shot weren''t quite so dark because I think the idea works. The glint in your right eye helps, though I think too much detail has been lost to the shadows.', '2006-05-23 21:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450946, 336397, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great concept. There appears to have been some post processing that introduces a very smoothing effect (especially in the skin), which to me makes it feel a little over processed.  Otherwise, I like the pose and the props are great.</td>', 'I think this is a great concept. There appears to have been some post processing that introduces a very smoothing effect (especially in the skin), which to me makes it feel a little over processed.  Otherwise, I like the pose and the props are great.', '2006-05-23 21:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450949, 336350, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think this idea has potential, though I wish there were more light on your face. I think that reversing the lighting of subject and background could work with the same feel the title suggests. If you selectively lit your face (or just a part of it) and left heavy shadows in the background I think that would look good.</td>', 'I think this idea has potential, though I wish there were more light on your face. I think that reversing the lighting of subject and background could work with the same feel the title suggests. If you selectively lit your face (or just a part of it) and left heavy shadows in the background I think that would look good.', '2006-05-23 21:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450958, 336027, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the off-center composition and smooth lighting in this shot.  The catchlights in your eyes are great, and the pose/expression is fun.  The background looks good all white. Great overall sharpness and exposure.</td>', 'I like the off-center composition and smooth lighting in this shot.  The catchlights in your eyes are great, and the pose/expression is fun.  The background looks good all white. Great overall sharpness and exposure.', '2006-05-23 21:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450967, 335804, 27767, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept for this challenge. I wish that your face and eyes were a little sharper since they are the main focal point. I think the pose is good and the lighting looks fine. I notice some image grain which I think would be fine sometimes, though I think the soft skin tones and soft lighting call more a smoother image without grain.</td>', 'Excellent concept for this challenge. I wish that your face and eyes were a little sharper since they are the main focal point. I think the pose is good and the lighting looks fine. I notice some image grain which I think would be fine sometimes, though I think the soft skin tones and soft lighting call more a smoother image without grain.', '2006-05-23 21:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450973, 335693, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very interesting composition.  Slick lighting.</td>', 'A very interesting composition.  Slick lighting.', '2006-05-23 21:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450980, 336403, 24642, '<td valign="top">Classy shot.  I really like the balance of the hair and the clothes.</td>', 'Classy shot.  I really like the balance of the hair and the clothes.', '2006-05-23 21:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450982, 334792, 27767, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this shot is very interesting to me, though I wish that the shadows were less harsh. Maybe a little reflected light or 1/4th power fill flash could soften them a little. I think the pose is great in it''s interaction with the background. The background is almost (but not quite) too dark since some of the details are lost and the writing is a little hard to read. The crack in the wall going down the right side of the image is a little distracting to me. Maybe cropping or clone it out would help. Great overall composition and focus.</td>', 'The lighting in this shot is very interesting to me, though I wish that the shadows were less harsh. Maybe a little reflected light or 1/4th power fill flash could soften them a little. I think the pose is great in it''s interaction with the background. The background is almost (but not quite) too dark since some of the details are lost and the writing is a little hard to read. The crack in the wall going down the right side of the image is a little distracting to me. Maybe cropping or clone it out would help. Great overall composition and focus.', '2006-05-23 21:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450985, 336338, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the compositon and the lighting.  Perhaps a bit to private? -7</td>', 'I like the compositon and the lighting.  Perhaps a bit to private? -7', '2006-05-23 22:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450988, 335670, 24642, '<td valign="top">Clever visual and conceptual blend.</td>', 'Clever visual and conceptual blend.', '2006-05-23 22:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450990, 336157, 27767, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of selective coloring. I think the crop is great and the focus is superb. The catchlights are very nice and strong. The smooth lighting works very well to create the very smooth skin tones.</td>', 'Excellent use of selective coloring. I think the crop is great and the focus is superb. The catchlights are very nice and strong. The smooth lighting works very well to create the very smooth skin tones.', '2006-05-23 22:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2450994, 333467, 24642, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2006-05-23 22:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451044, 333906, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beutiful.. Love the clarity and colors. Only suggestion would be to dodge the clouds on the top right to be a little whiter, just a personal preference.</td>', 'Beutiful.. Love the clarity and colors. Only suggestion would be to dodge the clouds on the top right to be a little whiter, just a personal preference.', '2006-05-23 22:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
