(2451309, 335383, 8624, '<td valign="top">pretty cool angle for this shot. I wish your hands with the camera weren''t reflected in the glasses and there is a blue cast to the white of your eyes, but I like this shot anyway.</td>', 'pretty cool angle for this shot. I wish your hands with the camera weren''t reflected in the glasses and there is a blue cast to the white of your eyes, but I like this shot anyway.', '2006-05-24 00:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451319, 336193, 8624, '<td valign="top">I actually played with a pose like this as well, but decided against it. I think your hands are too dominant and detract from your world weary expression - otherwise this is a good character and emotion study.</td>', 'I actually played with a pose like this as well, but decided against it. I think your hands are too dominant and detract from your world weary expression - otherwise this is a good character and emotion study.', '2006-05-24 00:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451321, 335672, 4767, '<td valign="top">YEAH!!! 9</td>', 'YEAH!!! 9', '2006-05-24 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2451332, 336028, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose, Steve!  Three things brought into sharp focus (to my eye, at least!)  One, the wedding ring.  Highlighted and tight focused. That''s a big part of who you are.  Two, the sleeves.  Were you inspired by the reaction from the reaction of that Colorado photog in Moab?  Three, your face.  Open, straight ahead, searching.  Helluvashot, all in all, my friend.  <br/> <br/>(Interesting, on further looking, that you have two shirts on, yet are stressing the tats.  The white under the black almost looks like a clerical collar.  Must''ve been YOU had the epiphany in Moab!)</td>', 'Interesting pose, Steve!  Three things brought into sharp focus (to my eye, at least!)  One, the wedding ring.  Highlighted and tight focused. That''s a big part of who you are.  Two, the sleeves.  Were you inspired by the reaction from the reaction of that Colorado photog in Moab?  Three, your face.  Open, straight ahead, searching.  Helluvashot, all in all, my friend.   (Interesting, on further looking, that you have two shirts on, yet are stressing the tats.  The white under the black almost looks like a clerical collar.  Must''ve been YOU had the epiphany in Moab!)', '2006-05-24 00:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
