(2452268, 336339, 38032, '<td valign="top">I was wondering whether I''d see any ovelaps between challenges.  The light is excellent here.</td>', 'I was wondering whether I''d see any ovelaps between challenges.  The light is excellent here.', '2006-05-24 08:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452269, 336388, 23430, '<td valign="top">Hey Rikki. You''re one of the few heads I know. You''re a legend photog and I''m average especially in people shots but I''ll give you my best critique anyway. Smile/expression is very good, you look relaxed. The centred composition looks good too. The shirt goes well. Exposure is good but maybe a bit heavy on purely front lighting. Skin tone and hair look slightly unnatural, sorry if that''s what you look like in real life :). Background is a bit boring and a bit close, I think it would have been OK if OOF but maybe better if darker as well. Overall pretty good especially for someone who doesn''t do a lot of portraits.</td>', 'Hey Rikki. You''re one of the few heads I know. You''re a legend photog and I''m average especially in people shots but I''ll give you my best critique anyway. Smile/expression is very good, you look relaxed. The centred composition looks good too. The shirt goes well. Exposure is good but maybe a bit heavy on purely front lighting. Skin tone and hair look slightly unnatural, sorry if that''s what you look like in real life :). Background is a bit boring and a bit close, I think it would have been OK if OOF but maybe better if darker as well. Overall pretty good especially for someone who doesn''t do a lot of portraits.', '2006-05-24 08:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452270, 335951, 38032, '<td valign="top">I am offended by the stylish awesomness of this.  This is an ad for jeans, right?  Was a simple flash used or something more complex?  Freekin WOW!   Also: if this isn''t you ... I take back all the good thinks I said before this :]<br/>---<br/>Upon looking at this a second time, I determined that this must be a backdrop of some kind.  The apparent 2nd light source is convincing though and overall the image is stunning.</td>', 'I am offended by the stylish awesomness of this.  This is an ad for jeans, right?  Was a simple flash used or something more complex?  Freekin WOW!   Also: if this isn''t you ... I take back all the good thinks I said before this :]---Upon looking at this a second time, I determined that this must be a backdrop of some kind.  The apparent 2nd light source is convincing though and overall the image is stunning.', '2006-05-24 08:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452271, 336261, 38032, '<td valign="top">Wow - lighting IS everything!!!  This is an amazing image - composition, color, simplicity, texture - the border in interesting too.   9</td>', 'Wow - lighting IS everything!!!  This is an amazing image - composition, color, simplicity, texture - the border in interesting too.   9', '2006-05-24 08:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452503, 335949, 32254, '<td valign="top">Was kinda cool when the first guy did it.</td>', 'Was kinda cool when the first guy did it.', '2006-05-24 10:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452513, 336272, 51003, '<td valign="top">I love the angle you took in this shot! AWESOME my friend!</td>', 'I love the angle you took in this shot! AWESOME my friend!', '2006-05-24 10:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452547, 335672, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great concept - and a fun one. Well executed too with not an insignificant amount of effort I suspect. You''ll doubtless be up there with this.</td>', 'Great concept - and a fun one. Well executed too with not an insignificant amount of effort I suspect. You''ll doubtless be up there with this.', '2006-05-24 10:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452552, 336230, 51003, '<td valign="top">love the angles here!</td>', 'love the angles here!', '2006-05-24 10:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452559, 335965, 51003, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!</td>', 'Cool idea!', '2006-05-24 10:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452565, 333542, 51003, '<td valign="top">SWEET SWEET IDEA! Total 7 from me!</td>', 'SWEET SWEET IDEA! Total 7 from me!', '2006-05-24 10:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452576, 333949, 51003, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS! My lord I have never seen so much prettiness! Great shot!</td>', 'GORGEOUS! My lord I have never seen so much prettiness! Great shot!', '2006-05-24 10:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452881, 336362, 59147, '<td valign="top">great shot .. I feel like I know him</td>', 'great shot .. I feel like I know him', '2006-05-24 12:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452882, 336354, 59147, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-05-24 12:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452884, 335977, 59147, '<td valign="top">I really, really like this, wish that the face had a little less exposure but I like it</td>', 'I really, really like this, wish that the face had a little less exposure but I like it', '2006-05-24 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452885, 336278, 59147, '<td valign="top">wow, thats intense.. nice work</td>', 'wow, thats intense.. nice work', '2006-05-24 12:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452887, 334765, 59147, '<td valign="top">another intense shot</td>', 'another intense shot', '2006-05-24 12:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452888, 336156, 59147, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2006-05-24 12:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2452890, 334047, 59147, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2006-05-24 12:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453013, 333255, 50695, '<td valign="top">You look different, Caleb! I like the overexposed window and the lines of light. the facial expression works perfectly for this theme of facing something that threatens to overwhelm you. 7</td>', 'You look different, Caleb! I like the overexposed window and the lines of light. the facial expression works perfectly for this theme of facing something that threatens to overwhelm you. 7', '2006-05-24 13:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453016, 336376, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice way to portray incompleteness. the color and darkness also add to the mood. 7</td>', 'nice way to portray incompleteness. the color and darkness also add to the mood. 7', '2006-05-24 13:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453022, 335949, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice use of DOF. the water drops are simply radiant, evoking the "Soul" in your title. 7.</td>', 'nice use of DOF. the water drops are simply radiant, evoking the "Soul" in your title. 7.', '2006-05-24 13:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453024, 336243, 50695, '<td valign="top">funny and it actually does make for interesting lighting. 7.</td>', 'funny and it actually does make for interesting lighting. 7.', '2006-05-24 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453029, 333976, 50695, '<td valign="top">effective minimalism, great expression, 7</td>', 'effective minimalism, great expression, 7', '2006-05-24 13:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453036, 333467, 50695, '<td valign="top">terrific visual feast, right down to the tailfins encircling your eye. Instead of predatory, you actually look like you''re in existential pain from being fragmented into all those reflections. 8</td>', 'terrific visual feast, right down to the tailfins encircling your eye. Instead of predatory, you actually look like you''re in existential pain from being fragmented into all those reflections. 8', '2006-05-24 13:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453041, 336235, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice mix of indoor and outdoor. the muted colors and "unsharpness" set a mood. I''ll meet you at the bottom of the scores pile! but personally, I''m giving you a 7.</td>', 'nice mix of indoor and outdoor. the muted colors and "unsharpness" set a mood. I''ll meet you at the bottom of the scores pile! but personally, I''m giving you a 7.', '2006-05-24 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453044, 336378, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how you reveal yourself being observer and observed at the same time. Every self portrait has this quality, but you make it explicit. Well done. 7</td>', 'I love how you reveal yourself being observer and observed at the same time. Every self portrait has this quality, but you make it explicit. Well done. 7', '2006-05-24 13:43:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2453047, 333542, 50695, '<td valign="top">thank you for the laugh! 7</td>', 'thank you for the laugh! 7', '2006-05-24 13:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453050, 336239, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed illusion, and I love your $h1t-eating grin! 7</td>', 'Nicely executed illusion, and I love your $h1t-eating grin! 7', '2006-05-24 13:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453052, 335996, 50695, '<td valign="top">great solemn mood. 7</td>', 'great solemn mood. 7', '2006-05-24 13:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453053, 336253, 50695, '<td valign="top">great expressiveness from your "model". beautifully lit. and its only helped by that tight crop. 7</td>', 'great expressiveness from your "model". beautifully lit. and its only helped by that tight crop. 7', '2006-05-24 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453054, 335374, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a good pun, and that''s a great one. Your facial expression seals the deal. 7</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a good pun, and that''s a great one. Your facial expression seals the deal. 7', '2006-05-24 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453058, 335526, 50695, '<td valign="top">exciting, thought-provoking image. it''s like a visual poem. 7</td>', 'exciting, thought-provoking image. it''s like a visual poem. 7', '2006-05-24 13:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453064, 336341, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a fascinating concept. The photographer does not look at us and therefore we cannot see her, even though she is using a mirror. You are subverting the purpose of a mirror AND subverting the purpose of a photograph. 8</td>', 'This is a fascinating concept. The photographer does not look at us and therefore we cannot see her, even though she is using a mirror. You are subverting the purpose of a mirror AND subverting the purpose of a photograph. 8', '2006-05-24 13:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453065, 334792, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic lighting for the drama queen, and you did a nice job of interacting with your background. 7</td>', 'Great dramatic lighting for the drama queen, and you did a nice job of interacting with your background. 7', '2006-05-24 13:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453069, 335377, 50695, '<td valign="top">You have created a dreamy effect here, much more dreamlike than American Beauty. Great folds on that fabric! 8</td>', 'You have created a dreamy effect here, much more dreamlike than American Beauty. Great folds on that fabric! 8', '2006-05-24 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453074, 333865, 50695, '<td valign="top">the glasses are in focus but you are not. would this have been more striking if your eyes appeared through the glasses, or just too weird? I don''t know, but good concept. 7</td>', 'the glasses are in focus but you are not. would this have been more striking if your eyes appeared through the glasses, or just too weird? I don''t know, but good concept. 7', '2006-05-24 13:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453077, 335713, 50695, '<td valign="top">good job limiting your palate. great shadow shapes in the fabric. 7</td>', 'good job limiting your palate. great shadow shapes in the fabric. 7', '2006-05-24 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453081, 335384, 50695, '<td valign="top">I get a sense of a quotidian, fun sort of enlightenment, like suddenly realizing you''ve got a beer left in the fridge. Nice expression, nice use of light. 7.</td>', 'I get a sense of a quotidian, fun sort of enlightenment, like suddenly realizing you''ve got a beer left in the fridge. Nice expression, nice use of light. 7.', '2006-05-24 13:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453083, 335672, 50695, '<td valign="top">well-executed illusion. I knew what to look for but still enjoyed finding it, I mean you. 7</td>', 'well-executed illusion. I knew what to look for but still enjoyed finding it, I mean you. 7', '2006-05-24 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453086, 334156, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, I do get the sense of Vogue and the 60s, but also some vulnerability. 8</td>', 'Yes, I do get the sense of Vogue and the 60s, but also some vulnerability. 8', '2006-05-24 13:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453088, 336232, 50695, '<td valign="top">you have created a positively iconic image. 7.</td>', 'you have created a positively iconic image. 7.', '2006-05-24 13:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453112, 336272, 33379, '<td valign="top">i really like this but the only thing i dont like is the color of the jacket, it blends in with the tree. great angle and pose IMO. Good Luck! well i had given you a 9, but i''ll bump.</td>', 'i really like this but the only thing i dont like is the color of the jacket, it blends in with the tree. great angle and pose IMO. Good Luck! well i had given you a 9, but i''ll bump.', '2006-05-24 14:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453117, 335011, 33379, '<td valign="top">very lovely, good luck!</td>', 'very lovely, good luck!', '2006-05-24 14:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453152, 335456, 45003, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and the make-up a lot, but I guess you should try different lighting next time. The flash makes your face overexposed and that''s a pity.</td>', 'I like your idea and the make-up a lot, but I guess you should try different lighting next time. The flash makes your face overexposed and that''s a pity.', '2006-05-24 14:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453160, 336395, 45003, '<td valign="top">Looks like Heida. Great shot. Your eyes are stunning, I keep looking at them. Love your idea too. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Looks like Heida. Great shot. Your eyes are stunning, I keep looking at them. Love your idea too. Nice lighting.', '2006-05-24 14:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453259, 334765, 42005, '<td valign="top">The porcelin company, Herend, should ask you to pose for them. This is a magnificent <br/>photo. I hope you win a ribbon. 10 Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'The porcelin company, Herend, should ask you to pose for them. This is a magnificent photo. I hope you win a ribbon. 10 Thanks for sharing.', '2006-05-24 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453264, 335916, 42005, '<td valign="top">Very emotive, clear, great use of shadows. 10</td>', 'Very emotive, clear, great use of shadows. 10', '2006-05-24 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453267, 334047, 42005, '<td valign="top">How lovely. 10.  Enjoy that baby.</td>', 'How lovely. 10.  Enjoy that baby.', '2006-05-24 14:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453268, 336392, 42005, '<td valign="top">Whatever product this is sellihg, I will buy it.  Great color, mood, energy and wonderful use of<br/>shadow. 10</td>', 'Whatever product this is sellihg, I will buy it.  Great color, mood, energy and wonderful use ofshadow. 10', '2006-05-24 14:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453270, 336232, 42005, '<td valign="top">Bet you play jokes on people too.  Nice, honest, well lit, and fun.  9</td>', 'Bet you play jokes on people too.  Nice, honest, well lit, and fun.  9', '2006-05-24 14:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453423, 335903, 49948, '<td valign="top">ha, thats cute<br/>nice colors</td>', 'ha, thats cutenice colors', '2006-05-24 15:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453426, 335871, 49948, '<td valign="top">great sharpness<br/>love the shot, way to go</td>', 'great sharpnesslove the shot, way to go', '2006-05-24 15:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453428, 335670, 49948, '<td valign="top">interesintg, gives such a calm feel<br/>the colors are very calming</td>', 'interesintg, gives such a calm feelthe colors are very calming', '2006-05-24 15:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453482, 336266, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the looks of this one.  To nitpick, the tone is a bit too saturated for my tastes, and the eyes seem just a bit softer in focus than I would like.  The composition and lighting are great.</td>', 'I really like the looks of this one.  To nitpick, the tone is a bit too saturated for my tastes, and the eyes seem just a bit softer in focus than I would like.  The composition and lighting are great.', '2006-05-24 15:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453490, 335384, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites so far.  The slight bit of yellow at the bottom helps add just a bit of brightness.  The lighting and pose are both excellent.  I wish the wrist watch was taken off, however.  The background wall gives good texture and depth to the shot.  Well done!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites so far.  The slight bit of yellow at the bottom helps add just a bit of brightness.  The lighting and pose are both excellent.  I wish the wrist watch was taken off, however.  The background wall gives good texture and depth to the shot.  Well done!', '2006-05-24 15:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453505, 336076, 14986, '<td valign="top">Maybe you were going for a particular type of look, but to me this is just an odd self-portrait.  The editing makes it a bit surreal and the pose and angle give an unnatural look.  With the elbows cut off, it almost gives a look of having four arms lol.  The lighting, however, is good.  I just don''t find the overall look very appealing.</td>', 'Maybe you were going for a particular type of look, but to me this is just an odd self-portrait.  The editing makes it a bit surreal and the pose and angle give an unnatural look.  With the elbows cut off, it almost gives a look of having four arms lol.  The lighting, however, is good.  I just don''t find the overall look very appealing.', '2006-05-24 15:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453514, 336405, 14986, '<td valign="top">Everything works together really well in this shot - the lighting, attire, gaze and background together give an almost sinister (for lack of a better word) effect.  The lighting and focus on the front eye really force the viewer to connect with the subject.  Excellent!</td>', 'Everything works together really well in this shot - the lighting, attire, gaze and background together give an almost sinister (for lack of a better word) effect.  The lighting and focus on the front eye really force the viewer to connect with the subject.  Excellent!', '2006-05-24 15:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453527, 334771, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like this alot...except the foot/leg sneaking in on the right is distracting.</td>', 'I like this alot...except the foot/leg sneaking in on the right is distracting.', '2006-05-24 15:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453543, 336244, 14986, '<td valign="top">This has a subdued appeal to it, I think.  However, since it is advanced editing, I would have softened the light glare that is on the tip of the nose, as it is distracting in the otherwise low light.</td>', 'This has a subdued appeal to it, I think.  However, since it is advanced editing, I would have softened the light glare that is on the tip of the nose, as it is distracting in the otherwise low light.', '2006-05-24 15:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453738, 335672, 38127, '<td valign="top">Already added to my fav''s ;) I love how your mind works and how your visions come to life.  I''d give you a blue Mr Man!! <br/> <br/>The soul that sees beauty may sometimes walk alone.<br/>Johann Wolfgang von Goethe</td>', 'Already added to my fav''s ;) I love how your mind works and how your visions come to life.  I''d give you a blue Mr Man!!  The soul that sees beauty may sometimes walk alone.Johann Wolfgang von Goethe', '2006-05-24 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453879, 335377, 55908, '<td valign="top">The flowing in the background against the flowing of the hair really makes this image work well! The splashes of color in the roses pull the neutral colors together superbly! One of my favorites! Great shot!</td>', 'The flowing in the background against the flowing of the hair really makes this image work well! The splashes of color in the roses pull the neutral colors together superbly! One of my favorites! Great shot!', '2006-05-24 17:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453898, 333949, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood in this portrait! I think B&amp;W was definitely a good choice conceptually and aesthetically. I would love to establish a better connection with the subject, but without eyes to see, it makes it a little more difficult. Just a personal preference of mine when it comes to reading portraits, but overall, I really like this shot!</td>', 'Wonderful mood in this portrait! I think B&W was definitely a good choice conceptually and aesthetically. I would love to establish a better connection with the subject, but without eyes to see, it makes it a little more difficult. Just a personal preference of mine when it comes to reading portraits, but overall, I really like this shot!', '2006-05-24 17:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453907, 334740, 55908, '<td valign="top">This images says a lot without being over-dramatic. I really like the simplicity! Good shot!</td>', 'This images says a lot without being over-dramatic. I really like the simplicity! Good shot!', '2006-05-24 17:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453921, 336185, 55908, '<td valign="top">Plain white backgrounds always get me excited for some reason! Good choice there! Fantastic connection with eye-contact as well! Great portriat overall!</td>', 'Plain white backgrounds always get me excited for some reason! Good choice there! Fantastic connection with eye-contact as well! Great portriat overall!', '2006-05-24 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453926, 336155, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is great! I commend you for your originality and imagination! The lighting is a bit flat to me, but the overall, I like this shot!</td>', 'This is great! I commend you for your originality and imagination! The lighting is a bit flat to me, but the overall, I like this shot!', '2006-05-24 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453931, 336246, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great color theme in your composition! Perhaps a little tiny bit of fill flash would put that spark in the eye. Nice work!</td>', 'Great color theme in your composition! Perhaps a little tiny bit of fill flash would put that spark in the eye. Nice work!', '2006-05-24 17:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453939, 336239, 55908, '<td valign="top">Really intreguing idea! Caught my attention for sure. Maybe its just my monitor, but the color balance feels a bit off. Otherwise, I think its a unique shot and quite well done.</td>', 'Really intreguing idea! Caught my attention for sure. Maybe its just my monitor, but the color balance feels a bit off. Otherwise, I think its a unique shot and quite well done.', '2006-05-24 17:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453948, 336355, 55908, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the technical quality just isn''t there for me. Seems a bit over-compressed and lighting feels a bit flat.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the technical quality just isn''t there for me. Seems a bit over-compressed and lighting feels a bit flat.', '2006-05-24 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453953, 335773, 29156, '<td valign="top">lol - you should be able to choose a point of view<br/> <br/>nice to have the background both blurred and colored like that<br/>so you stand out<br/> <br/>nice photo</td>', 'lol - you should be able to choose a point of view nice to have the background both blurred and colored like thatso you stand out nice photo', '2006-05-24 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453956, 336396, 55908, '<td valign="top">Looks like natural lighting which is always a nice way to go. But for me, it is very difficult to read and connect with a portrait without some catch light in the eyes. Also, the focus feels a bit soft on this image.</td>', 'Looks like natural lighting which is always a nice way to go. But for me, it is very difficult to read and connect with a portrait without some catch light in the eyes. Also, the focus feels a bit soft on this image.', '2006-05-24 17:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453978, 336334, 55908, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge! But I feel like the bright white of the paint palette in the foreground distracts attention away from the main subject. But I really like the fresh and unique idea!</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge! But I feel like the bright white of the paint palette in the foreground distracts attention away from the main subject. But I really like the fresh and unique idea!', '2006-05-24 17:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453997, 334687, 55908, '<td valign="top">What I like most about this image is how there is a documentary feel incorporated into the portrait to communicate the subject''s personality. I think the image''s simplicity works very well overall and the backlight is quite compelling. Great shot!</td>', 'What I like most about this image is how there is a documentary feel incorporated into the portrait to communicate the subject''s personality. I think the image''s simplicity works very well overall and the backlight is quite compelling. Great shot!', '2006-05-24 17:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2453999, 336338, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of contrast and lighting!</td>', 'Wonderful use of contrast and lighting!', '2006-05-24 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2454004, 335902, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very unique photo! The lighting feels a bit flat but I really like the concept!</td>', 'Very unique photo! The lighting feels a bit flat but I really like the concept!', '2006-05-24 17:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2454013, 334596, 55908, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! I like the contrast of color and b&amp;w. The whole image seems to illustrate a them of constrasts to me. The idea itself is well done. Great job!</td>', 'One of my favorites! I like the contrast of color and b&w. The whole image seems to illustrate a them of constrasts to me. The idea itself is well done. Great job!', '2006-05-24 17:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2454019, 336235, 55908, '<td valign="top">It is very difficult to connect with the subject of this photo.</td>', 'It is very difficult to connect with the subject of this photo.', '2006-05-24 17:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2454030, 335313, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very nice image! Selective saturation is so often abused, but I think the blue works very well here. Good job!</td>', 'Very nice image! Selective saturation is so often abused, but I think the blue works very well here. Good job!', '2006-05-24 17:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2454039, 335679, 55908, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice, but it would be nice to see some light in those eyes.</td>', 'The composition is nice, but it would be nice to see some light in those eyes.', '2006-05-24 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
