(2456925, 335949, 48717, '<td valign="top">Right, but I don''t think you will brown as Bear did.  This is a nice photo, colors and composition.  What will help you is that there are some other off topic shots that have you beat for The Brown:-)</td>', 'Right, but I don''t think you will brown as Bear did.  This is a nice photo, colors and composition.  What will help you is that there are some other off topic shots that have you beat for The Brown:-)', '2006-05-25 15:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456938, 335259, 48717, '<td valign="top">LOL, I like the processing on this one.  Love the way you continue to use the "cheese incident" in your favor!</td>', 'LOL, I like the processing on this one.  Love the way you continue to use the "cheese incident" in your favor!', '2006-05-25 15:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456959, 334156, 3724, '<td valign="top">A primer for absolute essentials of feminine style.  <br/>Shown here is a glimpse of something living inside women &amp; and to an extent all of us.     <br/>The basic timeless female expressions - adornment, hair, eyes, allure of body - universal but unique and presented as a legacy (title is perfect) in the form of a portrait.    <br/>J''s expression is unlikely to be guarded or defensive (which seems to be hinted  at) of a past which is perfectly intrepreted &amp; shown, never ashamed..... never faded, always in bloom.  This is MAGNIFICENT -  erotically charged - mysterious &amp; cool.</td>', 'A primer for absolute essentials of feminine style.  Shown here is a glimpse of something living inside women & and to an extent all of us.     The basic timeless female expressions - adornment, hair, eyes, allure of body - universal but unique and presented as a legacy (title is perfect) in the form of a portrait.    J''s expression is unlikely to be guarded or defensive (which seems to be hinted  at) of a past which is perfectly intrepreted & shown, never ashamed..... never faded, always in bloom.  This is MAGNIFICENT -  erotically charged - mysterious & cool.', '2006-05-25 15:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457007, 334759, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, pose and exceptional technical quality. Should be a ribbon winner.<br/> <br/>But I have to ask... do you have a signed release form from the model to use this image? LOL!</td>', 'Great lighting, pose and exceptional technical quality. Should be a ribbon winner. But I have to ask... do you have a signed release form from the model to use this image? LOL!', '2006-05-25 16:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457014, 336280, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting and pose. Wonderful color. Should be a top challenge finisher.</td>', 'Great composition, lighting and pose. Wonderful color. Should be a top challenge finisher.', '2006-05-25 16:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457029, 335429, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very moody composition. Grain works exceptionally very well here. If this were mine I would consider cropping the lens on the right out of the frame. In any regard this is one of the best portraits in the challenge.</td>', 'Very moody composition. Grain works exceptionally very well here. If this were mine I would consider cropping the lens on the right out of the frame. In any regard this is one of the best portraits in the challenge.', '2006-05-25 16:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457035, 334696, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot -- I like how you have cropped it, and your look just reaches out and grabs the viewer.</td>', 'Nice shot -- I like how you have cropped it, and your look just reaches out and grabs the viewer.', '2006-05-25 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457038, 334765, 5792, '<td valign="top">Man... you are soooooooooo dude!  Good composition, great side lighting and well framed. This has just the right amount of gritty darkness to give it a realistic medieval feel. Super job. Should be a ribbon winner just like that foxy chick with the yellow flowers. If she wins a ribbon you think I should hit on her?</td>', 'Man... you are soooooooooo dude!  Good composition, great side lighting and well framed. This has just the right amount of gritty darkness to give it a realistic medieval feel. Super job. Should be a ribbon winner just like that foxy chick with the yellow flowers. If she wins a ribbon you think I should hit on her?', '2006-05-25 16:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457040, 335306, 20462, '<td valign="top">come on.  This can''t get any better.  You better be rewarded.</td>', 'come on.  This can''t get any better.  You better be rewarded.', '2006-05-25 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457060, 335103, 5792, '<td valign="top">Incredibly good high-key portrait, nice perspective. It captures the essence of today''s modern woman. She is driven, smart, sexy and making a big impact on the corporate world. B&amp;W works well in this composition. Kudos to you. This should be a top finisher.</td>', 'Incredibly good high-key portrait, nice perspective. It captures the essence of today''s modern woman. She is driven, smart, sexy and making a big impact on the corporate world. B&W works well in this composition. Kudos to you. This should be a top finisher.', '2006-05-25 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457062, 335374, 24846, '<td valign="top">Neat contrast.Good luck.</td>', 'Neat contrast.Good luck.', '2006-05-25 16:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457069, 336157, 38161, '<td valign="top">WoW...<br/> <br/>nothing else to say ! 8</td>', 'WoW... nothing else to say ! 8', '2006-05-25 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457071, 335306, 38161, '<td valign="top">Haha ! Nice Expression ! I really like that pic, best of all for now ! 8 !</td>', 'Haha ! Nice Expression ! I really like that pic, best of all for now ! 8 !', '2006-05-25 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457075, 336272, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a creative portrait. Perspective and DOF are incredible in this one. Your use of muted colors and judicious dodge and burn adds tremendous mood to the composition. Great job, should place very high.</td>', 'Wow, what a creative portrait. Perspective and DOF are incredible in this one. Your use of muted colors and judicious dodge and burn adds tremendous mood to the composition. Great job, should place very high.', '2006-05-25 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457084, 335871, 5792, '<td valign="top">Composition and technical quality is exceptional. One of the best images of the challenge.</td>', 'Composition and technical quality is exceptional. One of the best images of the challenge.', '2006-05-25 16:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457096, 335965, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait David. Like the wide angle and composition. Has anyone ever mentioned that your profile image from self portrait III has a George Clooney feel?</td>', 'Nice portrait David. Like the wide angle and composition. Has anyone ever mentioned that your profile image from self portrait III has a George Clooney feel?', '2006-05-25 16:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457101, 336333, 5792, '<td valign="top">You project a compassionate curiosity with an almost delicate fragility in this self-portrait. It draws the viewer into the composition and makes them wonder what you are thinking. It''s simplicity is its strength.</td>', 'You project a compassionate curiosity with an almost delicate fragility in this self-portrait. It draws the viewer into the composition and makes them wonder what you are thinking. It''s simplicity is its strength.', '2006-05-25 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457107, 336339, 48717, '<td valign="top">You focus is so crispy, good job.</td>', 'You focus is so crispy, good job.', '2006-05-25 16:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457114, 336186, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wow. What a fantastic composition. It has high technical quality and conveys a bit of gloom we all imagine is a part of a boxer''s life. This could be professional boxer''s image on a fight card poster. Great job.</td>', 'Wow. What a fantastic composition. It has high technical quality and conveys a bit of gloom we all imagine is a part of a boxer''s life. This could be professional boxer''s image on a fight card poster. Great job.', '2006-05-25 16:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457121, 333255, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great composition, nice use of side lighting and a wonderful pose.</td>', 'Great composition, nice use of side lighting and a wonderful pose.', '2006-05-25 16:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457125, 335951, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative portraits in this challenge and it has a lot of creative ones.</td>', 'One of the most creative portraits in this challenge and it has a lot of creative ones.', '2006-05-25 16:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457128, 336053, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice setup. Like the full frame, angle of hat, glasses. Nice colors, just enough in the eye too. Good luck Yo!</td>', 'Nice setup. Like the full frame, angle of hat, glasses. Nice colors, just enough in the eye too. Good luck Yo!', '2006-05-25 16:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457131, 336247, 43404, '<td valign="top">Consider blending out the edges of the contacts. Otherwise- very nicely done.</td>', 'Consider blending out the edges of the contacts. Otherwise- very nicely done.', '2006-05-25 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457143, 336367, 5792, '<td valign="top">My intellectual side wants to say that the hand and sphere are out of focus and a tad bit to close to the edge of the frame but the color, composition, lighting and expression capture is great. Nicely done.</td>', 'My intellectual side wants to say that the hand and sphere are out of focus and a tad bit to close to the edge of the frame but the color, composition, lighting and expression capture is great. Nicely done.', '2006-05-25 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457156, 336185, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very well done high-key imagery. The application of warm tones is inspired and, overall, the image is of exceptionally high quality. Ya done good!</td>', 'Very well done high-key imagery. The application of warm tones is inspired and, overall, the image is of exceptionally high quality. Ya done good!', '2006-05-25 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457167, 336258, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in color Mambe ;-)</td>', 'Nice contrast in color Mambe ;-)', '2006-05-25 17:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457172, 336123, 40679, '<td valign="top">great detail of the stuff on your face. I hope it got off allright ;)</td>', 'great detail of the stuff on your face. I hope it got off allright ;)', '2006-05-25 17:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457173, 335257, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well setup. Retaining some muted color works well along with the judiciously applied dodge and burn. The use of soft focus is very nice touch.</td>', 'Well setup. Retaining some muted color works well along with the judiciously applied dodge and burn. The use of soft focus is very nice touch.', '2006-05-25 17:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457177, 336308, 40679, '<td valign="top">hello Jenesis ;-)<br/> <br/>If your entry had a little bit more contrast at the right, this one was awesome! but, the eye looks fine, so I wonder where it went wrong? or did you choose it to be this way? I''m very curious.<br/> <br/>you have a beautiful expressive face, besides of the contrast, well done :) bumping to 8 because I like it!</td>', 'hello Jenesis ;-) If your entry had a little bit more contrast at the right, this one was awesome! but, the eye looks fine, so I wonder where it went wrong? or did you choose it to be this way? I''m very curious. you have a beautiful expressive face, besides of the contrast, well done :) bumping to 8 because I like it!', '2006-05-25 17:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457180, 334696, 40679, '<td valign="top">your eyes.. your hair... nice!</td>', 'your eyes.. your hair... nice!', '2006-05-25 17:03:41.000000', NULL, 1);
