(2457329, 336288, 39484, '<td valign="top">Colors look cross processed or something.  It is sort of a neat effect if intentional.  Hope you don''t get too many negative comments about it.  With advanced editing, you could have darkened the upper and lower left corners to help keep the viewer''s eye from falling out of the frame.</td>', 'Colors look cross processed or something.  It is sort of a neat effect if intentional.  Hope you don''t get too many negative comments about it.  With advanced editing, you could have darkened the upper and lower left corners to help keep the viewer''s eye from falling out of the frame.', '2006-05-25 17:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
