(2457363, 336287, 39484, '<td valign="top">I like the detail and the sharpness.  The knuckles look a bit hot on my monitor, but every computer is different.  Nice shot</td>', 'I like the detail and the sharpness.  The knuckles look a bit hot on my monitor, but every computer is different.  Nice shot', '2006-05-25 17:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
