(2457393, 334968, 39484, '<td valign="top">Darn!  Almost a winner.  I love the concept and composition...really fantastic.  On my monitor, it is not sharp enough.  Especially with the hair being so interesting from a texture standpoint.  Anyway, great idea and keep shooting. 8</td>', 'Darn!  Almost a winner.  I love the concept and composition...really fantastic.  On my monitor, it is not sharp enough.  Especially with the hair being so interesting from a texture standpoint.  Anyway, great idea and keep shooting. 8', '2006-05-25 17:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457409, 335257, 59574, '<td valign="top">I love the movement.  It really captures the feminine protecting spirit.  Awesome work.</td>', 'I love the movement.  It really captures the feminine protecting spirit.  Awesome work.', '2006-05-25 18:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457424, 335103, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments and bumping up. Cool composition. Love the b/w choice. Just as a minor nitpick I would have liked to see either sharper eyes or less sharp glasses. As a result your eyes take a slight back seat to the glasses which is the first thing I notice. However, if this was used as a ad for a eye glass company this would work perfectly. Regardless of that I like this a lot. Good luck!</td>', 'Returning for comments and bumping up. Cool composition. Love the b/w choice. Just as a minor nitpick I would have liked to see either sharper eyes or less sharp glasses. As a result your eyes take a slight back seat to the glasses which is the first thing I notice. However, if this was used as a ad for a eye glass company this would work perfectly. Regardless of that I like this a lot. Good luck!', '2006-05-25 18:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457427, 334792, 36988, '<td valign="top">An oustanding image and very cool idea. Great job to a perfect little lady... :)</td>', 'An oustanding image and very cool idea. Great job to a perfect little lady... :)', '2006-05-25 18:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457429, 334649, 59574, '<td valign="top">you made me smile!</td>', 'you made me smile!', '2006-05-25 18:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457446, 335672, 49652, '<td valign="top">Creative and well done.  10 from me!</td>', 'Creative and well done.  10 from me!', '2006-05-25 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457450, 334792, 49652, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-05-25 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457457, 333769, 41337, '<td valign="top">This photo is nice and sharp and full of color and clarity. The camera settings you used and the lighting worked out great so good job there. I also like the composition. The main focus is off-center and I view this image from left to right which is natural for me. <br/> <br/>The only suggest I have for improvement is maybe having your mouth closed or show teeth. You seem to be in the middle of that which gives you an odd expression. Other than that I like the pose. You got a nice catch light in your eyes and your hair flows well through the image. Good job all the way around.</td>', 'This photo is nice and sharp and full of color and clarity. The camera settings you used and the lighting worked out great so good job there. I also like the composition. The main focus is off-center and I view this image from left to right which is natural for me.  The only suggest I have for improvement is maybe having your mouth closed or show teeth. You seem to be in the middle of that which gives you an odd expression. Other than that I like the pose. You got a nice catch light in your eyes and your hair flows well through the image. Good job all the way around.', '2006-05-25 18:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457461, 334765, 811, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, a new tool of smite, perhaps??? :)  Intimidating shot.</td>', 'Hmmm, a new tool of smite, perhaps??? :)  Intimidating shot.', '2006-05-25 18:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457469, 336394, 36988, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting and a very crisp overall great image... good job! 8</td>', 'Perfect lighting and a very crisp overall great image... good job! 8', '2006-05-25 18:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2457473, 335965, 36988, '<td valign="top">An excellent approach. Ver nice lighting and I particularily like the very effective DOF of this very worthy image... Well done! 8</td>', 'An excellent approach. Ver nice lighting and I particularily like the very effective DOF of this very worthy image... Well done! 8', '2006-05-25 18:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
