(2458267, 334047, 53147, '<td valign="top">Alot of amazing shots in this challenge, but this by far is the best straight forward portrait out there. No photoshop tricks (at least that I can tell) and no funny gimmicks. Just an outstanding shot and my top pick of the challenge. Bumping up to a 10. Your family will treasure this forever - beautiful.</td>', 'Alot of amazing shots in this challenge, but this by far is the best straight forward portrait out there. No photoshop tricks (at least that I can tell) and no funny gimmicks. Just an outstanding shot and my top pick of the challenge. Bumping up to a 10. Your family will treasure this forever - beautiful.', '2006-05-25 22:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
