(2459658, 334649, 28710, '<td valign="top">Man, I bet you hate the movie ''Wasabi''... It''s pretty popular here in TW too... Comes on the TV quite often and there''s always a copy of it in every video store...<br/> <br/>Being a pretty major fan of Jean Reno myself (actually, I like his characters but I can''t stand some of the movies he picks... probably more like most...), I would say that the facial expression captures some of the better qualities in his style...<br/> <br/>It looks so very Franco-Italian...<br/> <br/>Of course, your intent was not to portray Jean, but to portray yourself... <br/> <br/>On that, I think you did very well... Indeed, seeing as the first thing that jumps to my mind is Jean, I would say that you pretty much nailed the technicals... <br/> <br/>This should have scored a fair bit higher IMHO...<br/> <br/>Keep it up!</td>', 'Man, I bet you hate the movie ''Wasabi''... It''s pretty popular here in TW too... Comes on the TV quite often and there''s always a copy of it in every video store... Being a pretty major fan of Jean Reno myself (actually, I like his characters but I can''t stand some of the movies he picks... probably more like most...), I would say that the facial expression captures some of the better qualities in his style... It looks so very Franco-Italian... Of course, your intent was not to portray Jean, but to portray yourself...  On that, I think you did very well... Indeed, seeing as the first thing that jumps to my mind is Jean, I would say that you pretty much nailed the technicals...  This should have scored a fair bit higher IMHO... Keep it up!', '2006-05-26 12:19:09.000000', NULL, 0),
