(2459726, 336271, 28710, '<td valign="top">A great example of messing up the title I''m afraid...<br/> <br/>It would have done much better if it had said:<br/> <br/>Meaning of life is driving an air-cooled VeeDub!<br/> <br/>Yellow is clearly optional!<br/> <br/>Heh just kidding... I like the shot... I recently picked up a couple pairs of riding glasses, one in yellow and one in blue... I like the blue one for daytime and the yellow one for night time...<br/> <br/>The blue in the daytime makes me feel happier because it turns a cloudy day into a sunny day with blue skies... The yellow one at night makes everything more interesting and seem brighter...<br/> <br/>I agree with others that as a potrait, this could have had a much tighter crop to really put focus on you...</td>', 'A great example of messing up the title I''m afraid... It would have done much better if it had said: Meaning of life is driving an air-cooled VeeDub! Yellow is clearly optional! Heh just kidding... I like the shot... I recently picked up a couple pairs of riding glasses, one in yellow and one in blue... I like the blue one for daytime and the yellow one for night time... The blue in the daytime makes me feel happier because it turns a cloudy day into a sunny day with blue skies... The yellow one at night makes everything more interesting and seem brighter... I agree with others that as a potrait, this could have had a much tighter crop to really put focus on you...', '2006-05-26 12:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
