(2459753, 335672, 45672, '<td valign="top">Way to go.  This one took me a second to figure out.  Great great work.  I know it''s perfect the way it is, but I wonder how a set of iPod ear buds would look coming out of your ears.  With your eye''s closed, it seems like you''re listening to something.  Hence the earbuds.  They''re white too and I thought it might look cool.  Anyway, very very good shot and congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Way to go.  This one took me a second to figure out.  Great great work.  I know it''s perfect the way it is, but I wonder how a set of iPod ear buds would look coming out of your ears.  With your eye''s closed, it seems like you''re listening to something.  Hence the earbuds.  They''re white too and I thought it might look cool.  Anyway, very very good shot and congrats on your ribbon.', '2006-05-26 12:47:28.000000', NULL, 0),
