(2461280, 335351, 41522, '<td valign="top">Pidge, This is beautiful.  Excellent work.  Good work capturing yourself and such an important part of you as well.  Congrats.</td>', 'Pidge, This is beautiful.  Excellent work.  Good work capturing yourself and such an important part of you as well.  Congrats.', '2006-05-27 00:01:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2461297, 335761, 20530, '<td valign="top">Of all the "DNMC" conceptual shots, I liked this one the best. It really made me think, and I spent a bit of time with it. I''m not suprised that it did poorly; just because it''s pretty far away from the box (like in a different room), but I didn''t expect it to get the brown. I gave it a 6. Thanks for sharing it; and don''t let that score curb your enthusiasm.</td>', 'Of all the "DNMC" conceptual shots, I liked this one the best. It really made me think, and I spent a bit of time with it. I''m not suprised that it did poorly; just because it''s pretty far away from the box (like in a different room), but I didn''t expect it to get the brown. I gave it a 6. Thanks for sharing it; and don''t let that score curb your enthusiasm.', '2006-05-27 00:12:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2461332, 333822, 52336, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait, well framed.  Perhaps a little tight.  For example, more of your shoulders may have filled the frame out a bit, and keeping the hat entirely in the shot may have added to it.  The catchlight in your eyes is excellent.  I feel the image may have benefitted from more lighting, perhaps reflected onto the right side of the image (left side of your face).  As well, the image is slightly soft - would have benefitted from some more aggressive USM.  I think the choice of negative space as background is an excellent one.  The expression on your face is unaffected, giving it an overall genuine, yet still somehow guarded (mysterious?) feeling.  Well done.</td>', 'A nice portrait, well framed.  Perhaps a little tight.  For example, more of your shoulders may have filled the frame out a bit, and keeping the hat entirely in the shot may have added to it.  The catchlight in your eyes is excellent.  I feel the image may have benefitted from more lighting, perhaps reflected onto the right side of the image (left side of your face).  As well, the image is slightly soft - would have benefitted from some more aggressive USM.  I think the choice of negative space as background is an excellent one.  The expression on your face is unaffected, giving it an overall genuine, yet still somehow guarded (mysterious?) feeling.  Well done.', '2006-05-27 00:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2461439, 335804, 30048, '<td valign="top">nice eyes and nice looking.</td>', 'nice eyes and nice looking.', '2006-05-27 01:28:36.000000', NULL, 0),
