(2461624, 336231, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>this looks really noisy, and shutterspeed is a bit low as the eyes are not sharp.<br/>you could have used f10 1/30 sec and ISO 100 for a much better result, same exposure, lower ISO and the possibility to show movement of the hand without loosing the sharpnes in the face.<br/> <br/>and that vertical line behind you really must be vertical, so you have to straighten the image for a better result.</td>', '[[trading post]] this looks really noisy, and shutterspeed is a bit low as the eyes are not sharp.you could have used f10 1/30 sec and ISO 100 for a much better result, same exposure, lower ISO and the possibility to show movement of the hand without loosing the sharpnes in the face. and that vertical line behind you really must be vertical, so you have to straighten the image for a better result.', '2006-05-27 05:38:58.000000', NULL, 0),
