(2462332, 333943, 42125, '<td valign="top"><b>CTCP2 Gunnsi</b> <br/>First impression: Beautiful picture, lovely colours, perfect focus, crisp and clear.<br/>What can you do better?<br/>Stand a bit further from the wall to skip the shadow, the wall could be whiter in the left (your right).<br/>I gave highest 8 in this challenge. Three pictures and this was one of them. IMO this picture should have scored better.<br/></td>', 'CTCP2 Gunnsi First impression: Beautiful picture, lovely colours, perfect focus, crisp and clear.What can you do better?Stand a bit further from the wall to skip the shadow, the wall could be whiter in the left (your right).I gave highest 8 in this challenge. Three pictures and this was one of them. IMO this picture should have scored better.', '2006-05-27 19:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2462340, 333769, 42125, '<td valign="top"><b>CTCP2 Gunnsi</b> <br/>First impression: Nice and crisp, good focus and good title.<br/>What can be better?<br/>IMO crop a bit from the left. Lighting a bit harsh, maybe not wear white or dim the lights a bit.</td>', 'CTCP2 Gunnsi First impression: Nice and crisp, good focus and good title.What can be better?IMO crop a bit from the left. Lighting a bit harsh, maybe not wear white or dim the lights a bit.', '2006-05-27 19:28:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2462356, 336394, 42125, '<td valign="top"><b>CTCP2 Gunnsi</b> <br/>First impression: Happy guy, good shot!<br/>Pros:<br/>Good focus, good contrast, good lighting.<br/>Cons:<br/>The background is not clean, a bit to red :-), the shadow distracts.<br/>What could be done better:<br/>Go a bit further from the wall to get rid of the shadow.<br/>Nothing else to say, overall a really nice portraiture.</td>', 'CTCP2 Gunnsi First impression: Happy guy, good shot!Pros:Good focus, good contrast, good lighting.Cons:The background is not clean, a bit to red :-), the shadow distracts.What could be done better:Go a bit further from the wall to get rid of the shadow.Nothing else to say, overall a really nice portraiture.', '2006-05-27 19:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
