(2464492, 333822, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Very nice shot. This has great lighting. The hat adds interest. I can''t actually tell you any way to improve this unless you turned into Brad Pitt and shot yourself nude, LOL (just kidding ya know!). Maybe a little sharper around the eyes.</td>', 'Trading post...  Very nice shot. This has great lighting. The hat adds interest. I can''t actually tell you any way to improve this unless you turned into Brad Pitt and shot yourself nude, LOL (just kidding ya know!). Maybe a little sharper around the eyes.', '2006-05-28 22:34:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2464502, 336231, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I like the pose. It seems you have the same problem I had with my last entry. Not enough sharpness. The motion blur on the hand is good, but the rest looks grainy or slightly OOF. A lower ISO would probably help.</td>', 'Trading post...  I like the pose. It seems you have the same problem I had with my last entry. Not enough sharpness. The motion blur on the hand is good, but the rest looks grainy or slightly OOF. A lower ISO would probably help.', '2006-05-28 22:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2464508, 335693, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Wow, nice tattoo! This is a great image. I like the sharpness and lighting. I''m not too crazy about the all white background though. It kind of seems that you and your mirror are floating in space.</td>', 'Trading post...  Wow, nice tattoo! This is a great image. I like the sharpness and lighting. I''m not too crazy about the all white background though. It kind of seems that you and your mirror are floating in space.', '2006-05-28 22:42:17.000000', NULL, 0),
