(2465193, 333769, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hey Margie -<br/> <br/>I pretty much summed it up in my comment during the challenge, so I don''t have anything to add post-challenge. Good job on this one overall!</td>', 'Hey Margie - I pretty much summed it up in my comment during the challenge, so I don''t have anything to add post-challenge. Good job on this one overall!', '2006-05-29 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2465220, 336394, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hey Shailesh -<br/> <br/>The first thing I notice here is the red background. I''m going to contradict myself from my previous comment - after a few viewings, I''m not crazy about it. It''s a very harsh color and overpowers you. There''s a shadow on your hand that might have been eliminated with a reflector, and the picture isn''t perfectly sharp.</td>', 'Hey Shailesh - The first thing I notice here is the red background. I''m going to contradict myself from my previous comment - after a few viewings, I''m not crazy about it. It''s a very harsh color and overpowers you. There''s a shadow on your hand that might have been eliminated with a reflector, and the picture isn''t perfectly sharp.', '2006-05-29 03:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2465234, 335876, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Gunnar -<br/> <br/>You are absolutely right, the lack of focus killed you here. It''s definitely creative, but I think a bit too weird for this site. It reminds me somewhat of the fuzzy photos of Nessie, Bigfoot, and various UFOs.</td>', 'Hi Gunnar - You are absolutely right, the lack of focus killed you here. It''s definitely creative, but I think a bit too weird for this site. It reminds me somewhat of the fuzzy photos of Nessie, Bigfoot, and various UFOs.', '2006-05-29 03:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
