(2477882, 334596, 22734, '<td valign="top">You are funny! Very nice study. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'You are funny! Very nice study. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2006-06-02 00:48:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2477886, 333437, 31606, '<td valign="top"><br/><b> Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>Very nice image.  I was wondering how you done this.  A little play with mirrors.  The idea is a great one.  However focus seems to be a little off.  I would just like to see crisper lines and don''t really see anything in real good focus.  The lighting is just where it needs to be to give that spooky effect which is what I think you were going after.  The tight crop works well also.  Also I think it would do better if you were to look at the camera and kinda get that connection with your viewing audience.</td>', ' Critique Club  Very nice image.  I was wondering how you done this.  A little play with mirrors.  The idea is a great one.  However focus seems to be a little off.  I would just like to see crisper lines and don''t really see anything in real good focus.  The lighting is just where it needs to be to give that spooky effect which is what I think you were going after.  The tight crop works well also.  Also I think it would do better if you were to look at the camera and kinda get that connection with your viewing audience.', '2006-06-02 00:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
