(2477907, 333542, 36065, '<td valign="top"><b>--Trading Post Comment--</b> <br/> <br/><b>Camera Work/Technical:</b> Very creative, one of the most creative of the challenge.  This is a wonderfully executed double exposure, and it scored pretty well due to that fact.<br/> <br/><b>Lighting:</b> The flash looks a little harsh for the image on the left, but near flawless for the right hand image.<br/> <br/><b>Composition/Content:</b> Again, very interesting and very creative.  Great job with post-processing to finish with a very nice image.<br/> <br/><b>My Opinion:</b> I like it.  I think that it scored pretty close to its potential, and you ended up with another well-deserved 6+.<br/> <br/>Eric<br/></td>', '--Trading Post Comment--  Camera Work/Technical: Very creative, one of the most creative of the challenge.  This is a wonderfully executed double exposure, and it scored pretty well due to that fact. Lighting: The flash looks a little harsh for the image on the left, but near flawless for the right hand image. Composition/Content: Again, very interesting and very creative.  Great job with post-processing to finish with a very nice image. My Opinion: I like it.  I think that it scored pretty close to its potential, and you ended up with another well-deserved 6+. Eric', '2006-06-02 00:53:25.000000', NULL, 0),
