(2486601, 335693, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/> <br/>Well done and great score. I liek tyhe black and white treatment on this althoug the left side seems a bit too bright. Great focus on both of you. I would have liked to have seen either a slightly different angle on you or the knife to see more detail in the knife as it is kind of hiding in both places. A closer crop on the left would have gotten rid of some of the bright empty space without negatively affecting the shot over all I think. Overall though - a great idea and well executed.</td>', 'Trading Post - Well done and great score. I liek tyhe black and white treatment on this althoug the left side seems a bit too bright. Great focus on both of you. I would have liked to have seen either a slightly different angle on you or the knife to see more detail in the knife as it is kind of hiding in both places. A closer crop on the left would have gotten rid of some of the bright empty space without negatively affecting the shot over all I think. Overall though - a great idea and well executed.', '2006-06-05 13:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487693, 335747, 45115, '<td valign="top">This picture was unquestionably the very best of the challenge. I gave it a 10 without hesitation. The style, the crop, the B&amp;W, the DOF, the smoke and your "Marlon Brando" look... absolutely superb. A favorite!</td>', 'This picture was unquestionably the very best of the challenge. I gave it a 10 without hesitation. The style, the crop, the B&W, the DOF, the smoke and your "Marlon Brando" look... absolutely superb. A favorite!', '2006-06-05 20:30:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2487737, 335631, 48115, '<td valign="top">I liked this, im one of your 8s.. One thing that came to mind when i saw this was that it is such a gental pose maybe you should have taken your glasses of, just like you where going to sleep. The not shaved part adds to this, gives it that stron manly factor. I like your work and it is allso good to know someone has a eye for my own work :)</td>', 'I liked this, im one of your 8s.. One thing that came to mind when i saw this was that it is such a gental pose maybe you should have taken your glasses of, just like you where going to sleep. The not shaved part adds to this, gives it that stron manly factor. I like your work and it is allso good to know someone has a eye for my own work :)', '2006-06-05 20:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
