(2496650, 336231, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post -<br/>Sorry for being so behind. I gave you a 4 on this one. Alot of noise and lack of sharpness gave it a poor feel. I think the long shutter speed didn''t help much with that. A quick peek below at some of the other comments and most are pretty dead on I believe. Execution needs to be tweaked to get the higher scores. Playing around with differetn settings to see what comes up could be ab ig benefit.</td>', 'Trading Post -Sorry for being so behind. I gave you a 4 on this one. Alot of noise and lack of sharpness gave it a poor feel. I think the long shutter speed didn''t help much with that. A quick peek below at some of the other comments and most are pretty dead on I believe. Execution needs to be tweaked to get the higher scores. Playing around with differetn settings to see what comes up could be ab ig benefit.', '2006-06-07 22:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2498025, 336338, 27482, '<td valign="top">To be honest I gave this a 5 when I scored this challenge.  5 from me means for me average, neither good nor bad and I don´t really connect to the shot.  For me personally this got lost in a landslide of good images and I didn´t really connect to this image.  I think it´s the fact that the image is faceless and no eyes that doesn´t do it for me.</td>', 'To be honest I gave this a 5 when I scored this challenge.  5 from me means for me average, neither good nor bad and I don´t really connect to the shot.  For me personally this got lost in a landslide of good images and I didn´t really connect to this image.  I think it´s the fact that the image is faceless and no eyes that doesn´t do it for me.', '2006-06-08 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
