(2501112, 333769, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>CTPII</b> <br/>There''s a pretty straightforward SP. No gimmicks, just photography.<br/>Although I''m all for "experimental" photography, straightforward works for me as well. You did a great job on this, minus minor nitpicks that can be addressed in PP.<br/>One question: was your teeth clenched? Your expression give me the impression that it was.</td>', 'CTPII There''s a pretty straightforward SP. No gimmicks, just photography.Although I''m all for "experimental" photography, straightforward works for me as well. You did a great job on this, minus minor nitpicks that can be addressed in PP.One question: was your teeth clenched? Your expression give me the impression that it was.', '2006-06-09 05:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2503482, 335014, 48228, '<td valign="top">"WOW'' Jimmy I keep coming back to this shot as I just love it so much.....I love the feeling that you have portrayed, and you could definately be a "mime" artist, with that wonderful expression on your face..... It is now a member of my favorites photo collection, where it belongs, so that I can visit whenever I want.....</td>', '"WOW'' Jimmy I keep coming back to this shot as I just love it so much.....I love the feeling that you have portrayed, and you could definately be a "mime" artist, with that wonderful expression on your face..... It is now a member of my favorites photo collection, where it belongs, so that I can visit whenever I want.....', '2006-06-09 23:08:03.000000', NULL, 0),
