(2532705, 336232, 42916, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is technically good. You mentioned you just purchased photoshop. You should check out Scott Kelby''s Photoshop CS2 for Digital Photographers, It will really help improve your skills. That way you can really get a good feel for controlled edits and when to use certain techniques. It is one of my favs. Great Expression fits the title well.</td>', 'I think the photo is technically good. You mentioned you just purchased photoshop. You should check out Scott Kelby''s Photoshop CS2 for Digital Photographers, It will really help improve your skills. That way you can really get a good feel for controlled edits and when to use certain techniques. It is one of my favs. Great Expression fits the title well.', '2006-06-20 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
