(2565724, 336365, 28710, '<td valign="top">Man, this is fantastic!<br/> <br/>I love this composition and the execution is... well, fantastic!<br/> <br/>Ok, so it''s noisy as anything and it looks like it''s been cropped like a crazy white-tailed bass, but that''s hardly your fault... <br/> <br/>As might be guessed, I do have a bit of a soft spot for Escher.. ;)<br/> <br/>For the challenge, I think you might have been treading on thin ice with that chandelier... technically a light stand with multiple lights is still multiple lights... Same would go for a chandelier I would think...</td>', 'Man, this is fantastic! I love this composition and the execution is... well, fantastic! Ok, so it''s noisy as anything and it looks like it''s been cropped like a crazy white-tailed bass, but that''s hardly your fault...  As might be guessed, I do have a bit of a soft spot for Escher.. ;) For the challenge, I think you might have been treading on thin ice with that chandelier... technically a light stand with multiple lights is still multiple lights... Same would go for a chandelier I would think...', '2006-06-29 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2573869, 336401, 41337, '<td valign="top">I remember liking this one in the challenge but I guess I didn''t leave a comment. Speaking of which I liked yours about the cigarette and you don''t even mention the gun. Well, I agree this should have scored higher since you did such a great job recreating this. I would definitely suggest brightening it up just a hair but otherwise this is good as is.</td>', 'I remember liking this one in the challenge but I guess I didn''t leave a comment. Speaking of which I liked yours about the cigarette and you don''t even mention the gun. Well, I agree this should have scored higher since you did such a great job recreating this. I would definitely suggest brightening it up just a hair but otherwise this is good as is.', '2006-07-02 01:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
