(2581486, 336343, 33400, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moniepenny:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m feeling at a photography low point right now. So post your biggest photographic disappointment and how you got over it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Next time you''re feeling low, come back to this picture and remind yourself what you''re capable of.  I answered in your thread, but saw this and wanted to comment here as well.  This is a beautiful self-portrait and you obviously agonized over sharing this much of yourself. You have a good eye and understand the art of expression. <br/> <br/>Keep at it. You clearly love what you do.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by moniepenny: I''m feeling at a photography low point right now. So post your biggest photographic disappointment and how you got over it.   Next time you''re feeling low, come back to this picture and remind yourself what you''re capable of.  I answered in your thread, but saw this and wanted to comment here as well.  This is a beautiful self-portrait and you obviously agonized over sharing this much of yourself. You have a good eye and understand the art of expression.  Keep at it. You clearly love what you do.', '2006-07-03 23:26:53.000000', NULL, 0),
