(2593396, 336276, 3724, '<td valign="top">As karmabreeze mentioned....  "....blown highlights" have affect on how one views this.  I see the smoke conflicting to some extent in highlights with a marvelous quasi-nostalgic colour edit. Not that the effect should have been eliminated, the combined effect appears to be more successful in the black &amp; white outtakes, which I like very much.   However I found this portrait deserving at least the 6 I gave it.</td>', 'As karmabreeze mentioned....  "....blown highlights" have affect on how one views this.  I see the smoke conflicting to some extent in highlights with a marvelous quasi-nostalgic colour edit. Not that the effect should have been eliminated, the combined effect appears to be more successful in the black & white outtakes, which I like very much.   However I found this portrait deserving at least the 6 I gave it.', '2006-07-06 14:01:35.000000', NULL, 0),
