(2694995, 334156, 12611, '<td valign="top">Such a great self portrait. You''ve got that great hollywood feel; but you, the  artist, being the subject; you''re just staring right at the viewer; right through the viewer. Youv''e got all that skin showing and you cut it off just as low as you can; this is interesting, quirky, and probably could have placed a bit higher.</td>', 'Such a great self portrait. You''ve got that great hollywood feel; but you, the  artist, being the subject; you''re just staring right at the viewer; right through the viewer. Youv''e got all that skin showing and you cut it off just as low as you can; this is interesting, quirky, and probably could have placed a bit higher.', '2006-08-04 11:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
