(2819393, 336027, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m shocked I didn''t comment on this while voting - I''m sorry!<br/> <br/>Loved this, still do.  The only part of photography I despise is the self-portrait!  (if I looked as good as you maybe I wouldn''t - but that''s for me and my therapist to work out!)<br/> <br/>Love the lighting, and the color here - but most of all I''d like to think we see a good portion of your personality spilling out of this great photo.  That''s hard to do!  So this is great on all kinds of levels.<br/> <br/>I thought so then, I think so now.  Sorry I kept my mouth shut for so long!</td>', 'I''m shocked I didn''t comment on this while voting - I''m sorry! Loved this, still do.  The only part of photography I despise is the self-portrait!  (if I looked as good as you maybe I wouldn''t - but that''s for me and my therapist to work out!) Love the lighting, and the color here - but most of all I''d like to think we see a good portion of your personality spilling out of this great photo.  That''s hard to do!  So this is great on all kinds of levels. I thought so then, I think so now.  Sorry I kept my mouth shut for so long!', '2006-09-10 02:38:40.000000', NULL, 0),
